<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">Munukutuba Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Make</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mke</para>
  <para style="toc2">Make</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nsangu ya Mbote mutindu yawu sonamaka na Make</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nsangu ya Mbote mutindu yawu sonamaka na</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAKE</para>
  <para style="imt">NKOTOLO</para>
  <para style="ip">Nsangu ya Mbote mutindu yawu kele ya kusonama na Make, ya kele Nsangu ya Mbote ya kulutila nkufi, mpe bantu ke tubaka ti ni yawu sonamaka ntete na Bansangu ya Mbote nyonso. Na mbandukulu, kisoniki ke na kulakisa Yesu mutindu <char style="w">Mwana ya Nzambi</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:1">Mke 1.1</ref></char>). Kasi Yesu vwandaka zola ve ti ba zabisa yawu na pwelele nyonso (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 3:11">Mke 3.11</ref></char>). Yawu fwanaka vwanda mutindu yina, samu ti bantu lenda na kubakula yawu kaka na manima ya lufwa ya yandi na kulunsi mpe mvumbukulu ya yandi na lufwa.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">Dibuku yayi kele ya kukabuka mutindu yayi:</para>
  <para style="io">- Yowane Mubotiki ke na kusala kisalu ya kukubika bantu ya Isayeli samu na nkwizulu ya Masiya, mpe yandi ke na kubotika Yesu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-11">Mke 1.1-11</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">- Satana ke na kutonta Yesu na kati ya yinsi ya kuyuma. Na manima, Yesu ke na kulongisa bantu mpe ke na kubelusa bambevo. Awa, kisoniki ke na kulakisa bumfumu ya Yesu: ntangu Yesu ke na kubokila bantu na kulanda yandi, ntangu yandi ke na kulongisa bankonga ya bantu, mpe ntangu yandi ke na kubelusa bambevo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:12-8:30">Mke 1.12–8.30</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">- Kisoniki ke na kulakisa ti Yesu me kuma pene-pene ya kutala mpasi, ya lufwa, mpe ya kuvumbuka na lufwa na Yelusalemi. Na yina, Yesu ke na kuzabisa yawu bambala tatu na bilandi ya yandi, kasi bawu ke na kubakula ve mambu yina yandi ke na kuzabisa bawu. Konso ntangu, yandi ke na kuzonzila mambu ya yandi mosi na kutuba ti yandi kele Mwana ya Muntu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 8:31-10:52">Mke 8.31–10.52</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">- Yesu ke na kukota na Yelusalemi na nkembo nyonso. Yandi ke na kubingisa bitekisi yina ke na kutekisa na kati ya Yinzo ya Nzambi. Yandi ke na kupesa bandongosolo ya nsuka na bambeni ya yandi, na bankonga ya bantu, mpe na bilandi ya yandi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 11-13">Mke 11–13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">- Kisoniki ke na kuzonzila na yina me tadila bilumbu zole ya nsukunu ya luzingu ya Yesu. Ni awa, yandi ke na kuzonzila na yina me tadila madya ya nsuka yina Yesu kudyaka na bilandi ya yandi, lusambulu ya Yesu na Ngetesemane, wapi mutindu ba kangaka Yesu, wapi mutindu ba zengilaka Yesu lufwa, wapi mutindu ba kufwaka Yesu, mpe wapi mutindu ba tulaka Yesu na ndyamu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 14-15">Mke 14–15</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">- Kisoniki ke na kuzonzila na yina me ndyamu yina ke dyaka ve na kima na kati, mvumbukulu ya Yesu na lufwa, mpe mutindu yandi talanaka na bantu ya nkaka (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 16">Mke 16</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Na manima ya kutanga Nsangu ya Mbote ya Make, beno ke zaba mpe ti Yesu ya Nazaleti vwandaka ya tsyelika <char style="w">Mwana ya Nzambi</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 15:39">Mke 15.39</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ndongosolo ya Yowane Mubotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lke 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yne 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Nsangu ya Mbote ya <char style="w">Yesu-Klisto</char>, <char style="w">Mwana ya Nzambi</char> ke na kubanda awa. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Mutindu yawu kele ya kusonama na dibuku ya <char style="w">mumbikudi</char> Esaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Mu ke fidisa ntumwa ya munu na ntwala ya nge</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">samu na kuyidikila nge nzila.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Ndinga ya muntu yina ke na kulooka na yinsi ya kuyuma:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">“Beno yidika nzila samu na <char style="w">Mfumu</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">mpe beno sungika banzila ya yandi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Esa 40.3</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yowane Mubotiki kumaka na yinsi ya kuyuma. Yandi vwandaka botika mpe vwandaka zabisa mbotokolo ya kusoba nkadulu samu na kuzwa mulemvo ya masumu. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Bantu nyonso ya kizunga ya Zude mpe ya mbanza Yelusalemi vwandaka kwenda na sika ya yandi. Bawu vwandaka fungula masumu ya bawu na ntwala ya bantu nyonso, mpe Yowane vwandaka botika bawu na kati ya nzadi ya Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yowane vwandaka ya kuvwata kinkuti yina ba yidikaka na mika ya kibulu yina ba ke bokilaka samo, mpe singa ya luketo ya mpusu ya kibulu. Yandi vwandaka kudya makonko mpe mafuta ya nyosi ya mfinda. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Yandi vwandaka tuba na nkonga ya bantu: «Muntu yina ke na kukwiza na manima ya munu me lutila munu ngolo. Mu kele ve ya kulunga na kukondama samu na kunyangula basinga ya mapapa ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mu me botika beno na maza, kasi yandi ke botika beno na Mpeve ya Longo.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu me kuzwa mbotokolo, mpe <char style="w">Satana</char> me tonta yandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13">Mat 3.13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:11">4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Lke 3.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Na bilumbu yina, Yesu katukaka na mbanza Nazaleti na kizunga ya Ngalili, mpe Yowane botikaka yandi na nzadi ya Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ntangu yandi vwandaka basika na maza, yandi talaka zulu yina zibukaka, mpe Mpeve kulumukaka na yandi mutindu dibembe. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ndinga wakanaka na <char style="w">mazulu</char>: «Nge kele Mwana ya munu yina mu ke zolaka mingi. Ni na nge kele kilengi nyonso ya munu.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Kaka na ntangu yina, Mpeve ya Nzambi nataka yandi na yinsi ya kuyuma. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Yandi vwandaka kuna bilumbu makumi yiya, mpe <char style="w">Satana</char> tontaka yandi. Yandi vwandaka kintwadi na bibulu ya mfinda, mpe <char style="w">bambazi</char> vwandaka sadila yandi.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bokilaka bilandi ya ntete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4.12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Lke 4.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ba tulaka Yowane na boloko. Yesu kwendaka na Ngalili, mpe bandaka na kulongisa Nsangu ya Mbote ya Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Yandi vwandaka tuba: «Ntangu me lunga, mpe <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char> me kuma pene-pene. Beno soba nkadulu ya beno, mpe beno kwikila Nsangu ya Mbote.»<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yesu vwandaka tambula na kumu ya dyanga ya Ngalili, mpe talaka bilobi zole: Simoni na leki ya yandi, Andele. Bawu vwandaka loba, bawu vwandaka losa mpwasa na kati ya dyanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Beno landa munu, mpe mu ke kumisa beno bilobi ya bantu.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Kaka na ntangu yina, bawu bikaka bampwasa ya bawu, mpe landaka yandi. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yandi tambulaka dyaka fyoti, mpe talaka Zaki na leki ya yandi Yowane, bana ya Zebede. Bawu vwandaka na kati ya bwatu, mpe vwandaka yidika bampwasa ya bawu.<figure style="fig" alt="L’appel de Simon Pierre" file="lb00209b.tif" size="col" loc="Marc 1.16-18" copy="Louise Bass" ref="1.19">Mbokolo ya Simoni</figure> <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Kaka na ntangu yina, Yesu bokilaka bawu. Bawu bikaka tata ya bawu na bisadi na kati ya bwatu, mpe landaka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu belusaka muntu yina vwandaka na mpeve ya yimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Lke 4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu na bilandi ya yandi kwendaka na mbanza Kapenawume. Na kilumbu ya saba, Yesu kotaka na yinzo ya lusambulu ya ba-Zwife, mpe bandaka na kulongisa. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Bantu yina vwandaka kuwa yandi, vwandaka yituka na ndongosolo ya yandi, samu ti yandi vwandaka longisa bawu na mutindu ya muntu yina kele na bumfumu. Kasi ve na mutindu ya milongisi ya Misiku.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Kasi na kati ya yinzo ya lusambulu ya ba-Zwife, ya vwandaka na muntu mosi yina mpeve ya yimbi vwandaka kwamisa. Yandi lookaka na ngolo nyonso mutindu yayi: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Ee! Yesu, muntu ya Nazaleti, yinki nge ke na kusosa na beto? Nge me kwiza samu na kufwa beto? Mu zaba nani nge kele. Nge kele muntu ya longo yina Nzambi me fidisa!» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu ngalaka mpeve ya yimbi, mpe tubaka: «Vwanda swi, mpe basika na nzutu ya muntu yayi!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Mpeve ya yimbi ningisaka muntu yina na ngolo nyonso, mpe basikaka na kulooka na ndinga ya ngolo.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Bantu nyonso pamukaka, mpe yufulaka bawu na bawu: «Wapi mambu yayi? Muntu yayi ke na kupesa ndongosolo ya malu-malu na bumfumu nyonso. Yandi ke na kutumisa mpe bampeve ya yimbi, mpe yawu ke na kutumama na yandi!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Na nswalu nyonso, nsangu ya Yesu mwanganaka na kati ya kizunga nyonso ya Ngalili.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu belusaka mama ya kento ya Simoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Lke 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ntangu bawu basikaka na yinzo ya lusambulu ya ba-Zwife, bawu kwendaka kintwadi na Zaki mpe Yowane na yinzo ya Simoni mpe Andele. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Mama ya kento ya Simoni vwandaka ya kulala na mfulu samu ti yandi vwandaka na dibawu. Ntangu Yesu kumaka, ba zabisaka yandi yawu na nswalu nyonso. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesu kwendaka pene-pene ya yandi. Yandi simbaka yandi na diboko, mpe telemisaka yandi. Dibawu manisaka, mpe mama yina bandaka na kusadila bawu.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Na nkokila, ntangu bwisi yilaka, ba natinaka Yesu bambevo nyonso mpe bantu yina vwandaka na bampeve ya yimbi. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Bantu nyonso ya mbanza vukanaka na mantwala ya mwelo ya yinzo. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yandi belusaka bantu mingi yina vwandaka na bimbevo ya konso mutindu, mpe bingisaka bampeve mingi ya yimbi. Yandi bikaka ve ti bampeve ya yimbi zonza samu ti bawu zabaka nani yandi kele.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kwendaka na Ngalili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Lke 4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Na suka-suka, ntangu mwa mpimpa vwandaka ntete, Yesu vumbukaka. Yandi basikaka na yinzo, mpe kwendaka kisika yandi vwandaka yandi mosi. Kuna, yandi vwandaka sambila. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni na bampangi ya nkaka kwendaka sosa yandi. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ntangu bawu talaka yandi, bawu zabisaka yandi: «Bantu nyonso ke na kusosa nge.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Kasi Yesu tubilaka bawu: «Beto kwenda na bisika ya nkaka, na babwala ya pene-pene. Kuna, mu fwana kulongisa mpe, samu ti mu kwizaka samu na yawu.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Na yina, yandi kwendaka na kizunga nyonso ya Ngalili. Yandi vwandaka longisa na <char style="w">bayinzo ya lusambulu ya ba-Zwife</char>, mpe vwandaka bingisa bampeve ya yimbi.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu belusaka muntu ya bwazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Lke 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Muntu mosi ya bwazi kwizaka na sika ya Yesu. Yandi fukamaka na ntwala ya Yesu, mpe lombaka lusalusu na kutuba: «Kana nge zola, nge lenda kuvedisa munu.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu talaka yandi kyadi mingi. Yandi lambulaka diboko, simbaka yandi, mpe tubaka: «Mu zola, vwanda ya <char style="w">kuvedila</char>!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Na mpamukunu, bwazi manisaka muntu yina, mpe yandi belukaka. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Kaka na ntangu yina, Yesu kebisaka yandi mpe vutulaka yandi na kutuba: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />«Kuwa munu mbote! Kutuba yawu na muntu ve. Kasi kwenda lakisa nzutu ya nge na sika ya <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char>, mpe pesa munkayulu ya kuvedisa nzutu yina Moyize tumisaka. Yawu ke lakisa na bantu nyonso ti nge me beluka.»<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Kasi muntu yina kwendaka mpe zabisaka na bisika nyonso mambu yina kuminaka yandi. Na yina, Yesu vwandaka talana dyaka ve na bambanza. Kasi yandi vwandaka vwanda na ngaanda ya mbanza na bisika yina ke na bantu ve, mpe bantu vwandaka katuka bisika nyonso samu na kukwenda kisika yina vwandaka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu belusaka kikata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Lke 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Na manima ya mwa bilumbu, Yesu vutukaka na mbanza Kapenawume, mpe bantu kuwaka ti yandi vwandaka na kati ya yinzo. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Nkonga ya bantu vukanaka, mpe bisika manisaka na kati ya yinzo tii na ntwala ya mwelo. Yesu vwandaka longisa bawu mambu ya Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Mwa bantu kwizaka kuna, mpe natinaka yandi kikata yina bantu yiya vwandaka nata. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Kasi bawu vwandaka lenda ve na kulakisa yandi na sika ya Yesu samu ti bantu lutilaka mingi. Na yina, bawu yulukaka na muludi mpe tobolaka yawu na kisika yina vwandaka Yesu. Bawu kulumunaka kipoyi yina mbevo vwandaka ya kulala. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Ntangu Yesu talaka kiminu ya bantu yina, yandi tubaka na kikata: «Mwana ya munu, Nge me kuzwa mulemvo ya masumu ya nge.»<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Mwa milongisi ya Misiku vwandaka kuna, mpe vwandaka banza na kati ya bantima ya bawu: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Samu na yinki muntu yayi ke na kuzonza mutindu yina? Yandi ke na kusafula Nzambi. Kaka ni Nzambi lenda kulemvokila muntu masumu.» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Yesu zabaka mbangu mabanza ya bawu, mpe zabisaka bawu: «Samu na yinki beno ke na mabanza ya mutindu yina? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Yinki me lutila mpasi na kutuba na kikata: “Nge me kuzwa mulemvo ya masumu ya nge” to: “Baka kipoyi ya nge, mpe tambula”? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Kasi mu zola ti beno zaba ti Mwana ya Muntu kele na lutumu ya kulemvokila masumu awa na ntoto.» Na yina, yandi tubaka na kikata: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Mu ke na kuzabisa nge: Telama, baka kipoyi ya nge, mpe kwenda na yinzo ya nge.» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Kaka na ntangu yina, yandi telamaka, mpe bakaka kipoyi ya yandi. Yandi basikaka na meso ya bantu nyonso, mpe bawu yitukaka. Bawu vwandaka kembila Nzambi, mpe vwandaka tuba: «Nabunu beto tala mambu ya mutindu yayi.»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bokilaka Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lke 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu vutukaka na kumu ya dyanga ya Ngalili. Bantu mingi kwizaka na sika ya yandi, mpe yandi vwandaka longisa bawu. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ntangu yandi vwandaka luta, yandi talaka Levi mwana ya Alefe, ya kuvwanda na kisika yina ba ke futaka mpaku. Yesu zabisaka yandi: «Landa munu!» Levi telamaka mpe landaka yandi.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Yesu kwendaka kudya na yinzo ya Levi. Bilokoti-mpaku mingi mpe bantu mingi ya nkadulu ya yimbi vwandaka kudya kintwadi na Yesu mpe bilandi ya yandi. Ya tsyelika, bantu mingi ya mutindu yina vwandaka landa yandi. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Ntangu milongisi ya Misiku yina vwandaka na kati ya kimvuka ya <char style="w">ba-Falisye</char> talaka ti Yesu vwandaka kudya kintwadi na bantu yina, bawu tubaka na bilandi ya yandi: «Samu na yinki yandi ke na kudya kintwadi na bilokoti-mpaku mpe bantu ya masumu?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu kuwaka bawu mpe tubaka: «Bantu ya mavimpi ya mbote kele ve na nsatu ya dokotolo, kasi ni bambevo kele na nsatu ya yandi. Mu me kwiza ve samu na kubokila bantu ya <char style="w">kudedama</char>, kasi misumuki.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dyambu ya kumanga na kudya samu na Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lke 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Kilumbu mosi, bilandi ya Yowane Mubotiki mpe <char style="w">ba-Falisye</char> mangaka na kudya samu na Nzambi. Na yina, bantu kwizaka yufula Yesu: «Samu na yinki bilandi ya Yowane mpe ya ba-Falisye ke mangaka na kudya samu na Nzambi, kasi bilandi ya nge ke salaka yawu ve?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu vutulaka: «Beno banza ti bantu yina ba me bokila na <char style="w">mukembo ya makwela</char> lenda kumanga na kudya ntangu mulumi ke ntete na kati-kati ya bawu? Ve, ntangu nyonso yina mulumi kele na kati-kati ya bawu, bawu lenda kumanga ve na kudya. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Kasi bilumbu ke kwiza yina ba ke katula bawu mulumi. Na bilumbu yina, bawu ke manga na kudya samu na Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Ata muntu ke bakaka kitende ya lele ya malu-malu samu na kulonda kinkuti ya ntama. Kana ve, kitende ya malu-malu ke pasula yawu, mpe dibulu ke lutila nene. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Ata muntu ke tulaka vinu ya malu-malu na basaki ya ntama ya mpusu ya kibulu. Kana ve vinu ke pasula yawu. Vinu ke mwangana mpe basaki ke beba. Kasi ba ke tulaka vinu ya malu-malu na kati ya basaki ya malu-malu ya mpusu ya kibulu.»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kele mfumu ya <char style="w">Saba</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lke 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Na kilumbu ya <char style="w">Saba</char>, Yesu vwandaka luta na kati ya bilanga ya bambuma ya faline, mpe bilandi ya yandi vwandaka buka bambuma ntangu bawu vwandaka luta. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Na yina, <char style="w">ba-Falisye</char> tubaka na Yesu: «Tala bilandi ya nge, Samu na yinki bawu ke na kusala mambu yina misiku ke yiminaka na kilumbu ya <char style="w">Saba</char>?»<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu vutulaka: «Beno me tangaka ntete ve mambu yina Davidi salaka<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:2-7">1Sa 21.2-7</ref></char></note> kilumbu yina yandi mpe bantu ya yandi vwandaka na nsatu, mpe vwandaka ve na kima ya kudya? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Ntangu Abyatale vwandaka <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char> ya ntete, yandi kotaka na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, mpe kudyaka mampa yina pesamaka mutindu munkayulu na Nzambi. Misiku ya beto ke pesaka kaka muswa na <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> na kudya yawu. Kasi Davidi bakaka yawu, mpe kabulaka yawu na bantu ya yandi.» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yesu zabisaka dyaka bawu: «Nzambi yidikaka ve muntu samu na <char style="w">Saba</char>, kasi yandi salaka kilumbu ya <char style="w">Saba</char> samu na muntu. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ni yawu yina, Mwana ya Muntu kele mfumu ya <char style="w">Saba</char>.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu belusaka muntu ya diboko ya kufwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lke 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yesu kwendaka kota dyaka na yinzo ya lusambulu ya ba-Zwife. Ya vwandaka kuna na muntu mosi yina vwandaka na diboko ya kufwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Ba-Falisye vwandaka tala Yesu na nkebolo nyonso samu na kutala kana yandi ke belusa muntu yina na kilumbu ya saba, samu ti bawu vwandaka sosa dyambu ya kufunda yandi. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu tubaka na muntu ya diboko ya kufwa: «Telama mpe kwiza awa na ntwala ya bantu nyonso.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Na manima, yandi yufulaka bawu: «Yinki ke tubaka misiku ya beto? Kusala muntu mbote to yimbi na kilumbu ya saba? Kuvuukisa muntu to kufwa yandi?» Kasi bawu pesaka mvutu ve. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu talaka bawu na nkele nyonso. Yandi vwandaka ya kufuluka na kyadi samu ti bawu vwandaka na ntima ngolo. Na yina, yandi tubaka na muntu yina: «Lambula diboko ya nge.» Yandi lambulaka diboko ya yandi, mpe yawu belukaka. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" /><char style="w">Ba-Falisye</char> basikaka mpe vukanaka na nswalu nyonso na bantu ya kimvuka ya Elode samu na kutala wapi mutindu bawu lenda kufwa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na kati ya nkonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu kwendaka na bilandi ya yandi na kumu ya dyanga ya Ngalili, mpe bantu mingi landaka yandi. Bawu katukaka na Ngalili, mpe na Zude, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />na Yelusalemi, na Idume, na babwala ya pene-pene na nzadi ya Yolodani, mpe na bizunga ya bambanza Tile mpe Sidone. Bawu kwizaka mingi samu ti bawu kuwaka mambu nyonso yina Yesu vwandaka sala. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Na yina, Yesu tubaka na bilandi ya yandi na kukubikila yandi bwatu, samu ti nkonga ya bantu fyetikisa yandi ve. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Mutindu Yesu vwandaka belusa bantu mingi, bantu nyonso yina vwandaka na bimbevo vwandaka sosa na kusimba yandi. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ntangu bayina vwandaka na bampeve ya yimbi vwandaka tala Yesu, bawu vwandaka kubwa na ntwala ya yandi na kulooka: «Nge kele <char style="w">Mwana ya Nzambi</char>.» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Kasi Yesu vwandaka yimina bawu na ngolo nyonso na kutuba na bantu nani yandi kele.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu soolaka <char style="w">bantumwa</char> kumi na zole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lke 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Na manima, yandi kwendaka na mongo. Yandi bokilaka bayina yandi zolaka, mpe bawu kwizaka na sika ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Yandi soolaka <char style="w">bantumwa</char> kumi na zole samu ti bawu vwanda na yandi, mpe samu na kufidisa bawu na kulongisa Nsangu ya Mbote. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Yandi pesaka bawu mpe lulendo ya kubingisa bampeve ya yimbi. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Bankumbu ya bawu kele: Simoni yina yandi pesaka nkumbu Pyele, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Zaki na leki ya yandi Yowane, bawu zole bana ya Zebede. Yesu pesaka bawu nkumbu Bwanengese yina zola kutuba «bana ya kidumu», <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andele, Filipe, Baatelemi, Matayi, Toma, Zaki mwana ya Alefe, Tade, Simoni yina vwandaka na ntama muntu ya kimvuka ya Zelote<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na ntangu ya Yesu, bantu ya kimvuka ya Zelote vwandaka ba-Zwife yina vwandaka nwanisa bantu ya Loma, samu na kimpwanza ya yinsi ya Isayeli.</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />mpe Yuda Isekayote yina yekulaka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Na manima, Yesu vutukaka na yinzo. Nkonga ya nene ya bantu vukanaka dyaka, mpe Yesu na bilandi ya yandi lendaka ve na kudya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ntangu bantu ya dikanda ya yandi kuwaka mambu yina, bawu kwizaka na sika ya Yesu samu na kubaka yandi, samu ti bawu vwandaka tuba ti yandi ke na kuzaba dyaka ve mambu yina yandi ke na kusala.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu pesaka mvutu na milongisi ya Misiku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Lke 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Milongisi ya Misiku yina katukaka na Yelusalemi vwandaka tuba: «<char style="w">Bezebule</char> kele na kati ya yandi, ni mfumu ya bampeve ya yimbi ke pesaka yandi lulendo ya kubingisa bampeve ya yimbi.» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Na yina, Yesu bokilaka bawu mpe zonzilaka bawu na bingana: «Wapi mutindu <char style="w">Satana</char> lenda kubingisa dyaka yandi mosi Satana? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Kana bantu ya yinsi mosi nwana bawu na bawu, yinsi yina ke mwangana. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Kana bantu ya dikanda mosi nwana bawu na bawu, dikanda yina ke mwangana. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Na yina, kana <char style="w">Satana</char> ke na kunwana na yandi mosi, mpe kana yandi kele ya kukabuka, lulendo ya yandi ke tatamana ve, kasi yawu ke manisa. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Ata muntu lenda kukota na yinzo ya muntu ya ngolo, mpe kubaka yandi bima kana yandi me kanga yandi ntete ve basinga. Kasi kana yandi me kanga muntu yina basinga, yandi lenda kubaka yandi bima nyonso yina kele na kati ya yinzo.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />«Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kuzabisa beno: Bantu ke kuzwa mulemvo na masumu nyonso ya bawu, mpe na konso mutindu bawu ke safula Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Kasi muntu yina ke safula Mpeve ya Longo, ke kuzwa ve mulemvo ya masumu samu ti yandi me sala disumu ya seko.» <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu zonzilaka bawu mutindu yina samu ti bawu vwandaka tuba ti yandi kele na mpeve ya yimbi.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mama mpe bampangi ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lke 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Mama mpe bampangi ya Yesu kwizaka. Bawu vwandaka na ngaanda mpe fidisaka muntu samu na kubokila yandi. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Bantu mingi vwandaka ya kuvwanda na Yesu, mpe ba zabisaka yandi: «Mama mpe bampangi ya nge kele na ngaanda. Bawu ke na kusosa nge.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu vutulaka: «Nani kele mama mpe bampangi ya munu?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Na manima, yandi talaka bantu nyonso yina vwandaka ya kuvwanda na balweka nyonso ya yandi, mpe tubaka: «Tala! Mama mpe bampangi ya munu, bawu yayi.» <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Ya tsyelika, konso muntu yina ke salaka mambu yina Nzambi ke zolaka, ni yandi kele mpangi, kibusi, mpe mama ya munu.<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kingana ya kisadi-bilanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lke 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu bandaka dyaka na kulongisa na kumu ya dyanga ya Ngalili. Nkonga ya nene ya bantu zungaka yandi. Ni yawu yina, yandi kwendaka vwanda na kati ya bwatu. Bwatu vwandaka na zulu ya maza, mpe nkonga ya bantu vwandaka na ntoto pene-pene na maza. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Yandi vwandaka longisa bawu mambu mingi na bingana. Na ndongosolo ya yandi, yandi zabisaka bawu: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Beno kuwa! Kilumbu mosi, muntu mosi kwendaka na bilanga samu na kumwanga bambuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Ntangu yandi vwandaka mwanga bambuma, ndambu ya bambuma kubwaka na lweka ya nzila. Bandeke kwizaka mpe dodaka yawu. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Ndambu ya nkaka ya bambuma kubwaka na ntoto ya matadi kisika vwandaka ve ntoto mingi. Bambuma menaka mbangu samu ti ntoto vwandaka mingi ve. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Kasi ntangu basikaka mpe yokaka bambuma yina vwandaka mena. Bambuma yumaka samu ti myanzi vwandaka ve yinda. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Ndambu ya nkaka ya bambuma kubwaka na kisika ya matiti ya bansende. Matiti ya bansende kulaka mpe yawu fyetikisaka bambuma yina vwandaka mena. Na yina, mwa bayinti yina menaka butaka ve bambuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Kasi bambuma ya nkaka kubwaka na ntoto ya mbote. Mwa bayinti basikaka, kulaka mpe butaka bambuma. Bayinti ya nkaka butaka bambuma makumi tatu, ya nkaka bambuma makumi sambanu, mpe ya nkaka dyaka bambuma nkama.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Na kumanisa Yesu tubaka: «Muntu yina kele na makutu samu na kuwa, yandi kuwa.»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samu na yinki Yesu ke na kuzonza na bingana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Lke 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Ntangu nkonga ya bantu kwendaka, bilandi ya Yesu mpe bayina vwandaka zunga yandi yufulaka yandi nsasa ya bingana yina. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu tubilaka bawu: «Beno kuzwaka luve ya kuzaba mansweki ya <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char>. Kasi bantu ya nkaka ke kuwaka yawu kaka na bingana, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />samu ti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">«“Bawu ke zibula mbote meso, kasi bawu ke tala ve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Bawu ke kuwa mbote, kasi bawu ke visa ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">kana ve bawu ke vutuka ve na sika ya Nzambi, mpe Nzambi ke lemvokila bawu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Esa 6.9-10</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ke na kubangula kingana ya kisadi-bilanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lke 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yesu tubilaka dyaka bawu: «Kana beno ke na kubakula ve kingana yayi, wapi mutindu beno ke bakula bingana nyonso ya nkaka? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Kisadi-bilanga ke na kumwanga Mambu ya Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Bantu ya nkaka kele mutindu lweka ya nzila kisika kubwaka bambuma. Ntangu bawu ke kuwaka mambu ya Nzambi, <char style="w">Satana</char> ke kwizaka mpe ke katulaka bawu yawu. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Bantu ya nkaka kele mutindu ntoto ya matadi kisika kubwaka bambuma. Ntangu bawu ke kuwaka mambu ya Nzambi, bawu ke ndimaka yawu na nswalu na kyese nyonso. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Kasi bawu ke bikaka ve ti yawu kuzwa kisika na kati ya bantima ya bawu. Bawu ke kwikilaka kaka mwa ntangu fyoti. Ntangu bantontolo to bankwamusu ke kuminaka bawu samu na mambu ya Nzambi, bawu ke vwandaka dyaka ve na kiminu. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Bantu ya nkaka dyaka kele mutindu ntoto ya matiti ya bansende kisika kubwaka bambuma. Bawu ke kuwaka mambu ya Nzambi, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />kasi manyongo samu na mambu ya yinza, bansatu ya yimbi samu na kuzwa bimvwama, mpe bansatu ya nkaka ya yimbi ke kwamisaka Mambu ya Nzambi yina bawu ke kuwaka, mpe yawu ke butaka ve bambuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Bantu ya nkaka kele mutindu ntoto ya mbote kisika kubwaka bambuma. Bawu ke kuwaka Mambu ya Nzambi, ke ndimaka yawu, mpe ke butaka bambuma. Bantu ya nkaka ke butaka bambuma makumi tatu, ba ya nkaka ke butaka bambuma makumi sambanu, mpe ba ya nkaka dyaka bambuma nkama.»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ya mwinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Lke 8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Na manima, Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Ata muntu ke namisaka mwinda samu na kutula yawu na yisi ya kantini to na yisi ya mfulu. Kasi ba ke tulaka yawu na zulu ya kitentokolo ya mwinda. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Mambu nyonso yina kele ya kubumbama ke talana na pwelele nyonso, mpe mambu nyonso ya mansweki ke zabana. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Kana muntu kele na makutu, yandi kuwa.» <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu zabisaka dyaka bawu: «Beno sala keba na mambu yina beno ke kuwaka. Na kitezolo yina beno ke sadilaka bampangi, ni na kitezolo yina mpe, Nzambi ke sadila samu na beno, mpe ba ke bwela dyaka. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Na muntu yina ke na bima, ba ke bwela yandi bima ya nkaka. Kasi na muntu yina ke na kima ve, ba ke katula yandi ndambu ya bima yina ke na yandi.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ya bambuma yina ke menaka yawu mosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu tubaka dyaka: «<char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char> kele mutindu mbuma yina muntu me baka mpe me mwanga na bilanga ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Ntangu yandi ke lalaka na mpimpa mpe ke tambulaka na ntangu, mbuma yina ke basikaka mpe ke yelaka. Kasi yandi ke zabaka ve wapi mutindu yawu ke salamaka. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Ntoto ke menisaka yawu mosi bambuma. Yawu ke basisaka ntete yinti. Na manima, yinti ke bandaka na kubasisa mbuma, mpe mbuma ke yelaka. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Ntangu bambuma ke yelaka, ba ke bakaka kisalulu ya kubuka bambuma, samu ti ntangu ya kuyonzika bambuma me lunga.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ya mbuma ya mutaade</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13.31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Lke 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu zabisaka dyaka bawu: «Na yinki beto lenda kufwanikisa <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char> to na wapi kingana beto lenda kuzonzila yawu? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" /><char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char> kele mutindu mbuma ya mutaade<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:32">Mat 13.32</ref></char></note>. Ntangu ba ke kunaka yawu, yawu ke lutilaka fyoti na bambuma nyonso ya yinza. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Kasi na manima, yawu ke menaka mpe ke lutilaka yinda na bima nyonso yina ba me kuna na bilanga. Yawu ke basisaka bintala ya nene, mpe bandeke ke tungaka mazanza ya bawu na zulu ya yawu.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu longisaka mambu ya Nzambi na bingana mingi ya mutindu yayi. Yandi vwandaka longisa bawu yawu na mutindu lendaka bakula bayina vwandaka kuwa yandi. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Yandi vwandaka zonzila bawu kaka na bingana. Kasi ntangu yandi vwandaka bikana na bilandi ya yandi, yandi vwandaka bangudila bawu mambu nyonso.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu dingimisaka kitembo ya ngolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lke 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Kaka na nkokila ya kilumbu yina, Yesu tubaka na bilandi ya yandi: «Beto sabuka na simu ya nkaka ya dyanga.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Na yina, bawu bikaka nkonga ya bantu, mpe bilandi nataka bwatu yina vwandaka Yesu. Babwatu ya nkaka mpe vwandaka pene-pene na yandi. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Kitembo ya ngolo fulaka. Bimpo ya maza vwandaka ningisa bwatu, mpe bwatu bandaka na kufuluka na maza. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu vwandaka lala na manima, mpe tulaka yintu na zulu ya mwa kifunda ya lele. Na yina, bilandi vumbulaka yandi, mpe tubaka: «Mulongisi, beto ke kufwa! Ya ke na kusala nge ntima mpasi ve?»<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu vumbukaka. Yandi tumisaka na ngolo nyonso kitembo na kudingama, mpe tubaka na maza ya dyanga: «Vwanda swi! Dingama!» Na yina, kitembo dingamaka, mpe bima nyonso kumaka swi. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Na manima, Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Samu na yinki beno ke na boma? Beno ke ntete ve na kiminu?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Kasi bawu kumaka na boma mingi, mpe yufulaka bawu na bawu: «Nani kele muntu yayi samu ti kitembo mpe maza ya dyanga tumama na yandi?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu belusaka muntu yina vwandaka na bampeve ya yimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Lke 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Na manima, bawu kumaka na simu ya nkaka ya dyanga ya Ngalili na kizunga ya bantu ya Ngenezalete. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Kaka ntangu Yesu basikaka na bwatu, muntu mosi yina vwandaka na mpeve ya yimbi basikaka na kati-kati ya bandyamu, mpe kwizaka bwabana Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Yandi vwandaka zinga kisika kele bandyamu, mpe ata muntu vwandaka lenda kukanga yandi basinga, ata ti yawu vwandaka ya bisengo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Bantangu ya nkaka, ba vwandaka kanga yandi maboko na makulu na basinga ya bisengo. Kasi yandi vwandaka zenga yawu, mpe ata muntu vwandaka lenda dyaka na kukutika yandi. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Mpimpa na ntangu, yandi vwandaka zinga na kati-kati ya bandyamu, mpe na zulu ya myongo. Kuna, yandi vwandaka looka mpe lwalisa nzutu ya yandi na matadi.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ntangu yandi talaka Yesu yina vwandaka ntete ntama, yandi kwendaka mbangu na sika ya Yesu, mpe fukamaka. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Yandi lookaka na ngolo nyonso: «Yesu! <char style="w">Mwana ya Nzambi</char>-Mpungu, yinki nge ke na kusosa na munu? Na Nkumbu ya Nzambi, mu ke na kulomba nge: Kukwamisa munu ve!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Yandi tubaka mutindu yina samu ti Yesu zabisaka yandi: «Mpeve ya yimbi, basika na nzutu ya muntu yayi!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesu yufulaka yandi: «Nkumbu ya nge nani?» Yandi vutulaka: «Nkumbu ya munu Nkonga samu ti beto kele mingi.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Yandi tatamanaka na kubondila Yesu na kufidisa ve bampeve yina na kizunga ya nkaka.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Na kisika yina, ya vwandaka na nkonga ya nene ya bangulu yina vwandaka sosa madya na mongo. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Bampeve ya yimbi bondilaka Yesu na kutuba: «Fidisa beto na sika ya bangulu yina samu ti beto kota na bawu.» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu pesaka bawu muswa. Na yina, bampeve ya yimbi basikaka na nzutu ya muntu yina, mpe kwendaka kota na kati ya bangulu. Bangulu kulumukaka na nswalu nyonso kubanda na zulu ya mongo tii na kati ya dyanga, mpe dyamaka. Ya lendaka vwanda mafunda zole (2 000) ya bangulu.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Mikengi ya bangulu kimaka mpe kwendaka mwangisa nsangu na kati ya mbanza mpe bayinzo ya mivungi. Na yina, bantu kwizaka tala mambu yina salamaka. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Bawu kumaka kisika vwandaka Yesu, mpe talaka muntu yina Yesu bingisaka bampeve ya yimbi. Yandi vwandaka ya kuvwanda, lwataka bilele, mpe kumaka na mabanza ya kulunga. Na yina, bawu kumaka na boma. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Bayina talaka mambu nyonso yina, zabisaka bawu mambu kuminaka muntu yina vwandaka na bampeve ya yimbi, mpe mambu yina kuminaka bangulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Na yina, bawu lombaka Yesu na kukatuka na kizunga ya bawu.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Ntangu Yesu vwandaka kota na bwatu, muntu yina yandi bingisaka bampeve ya yimbi lombaka ti yandi kwenda na yandi. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesu pesaka ve yandi muswa, kasi yandi zabisaka yandi: «Vutuka na kisika ya bantu ya nge, mpe zabisa bawu mambu nyonso yina <char style="w">Mfumu</char> me sala samu na nge, mpe wapi mutindu yandi me tala nge kyadi.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Na yina, muntu yango kwendaka mpe zabisaka na kati ya kizunga ya Bambanza-Kumi mambu nyonso yina Yesu salaka yandi. Bayina nyonso kuwaka yandi yitukaka mingi.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu belusaka kento mosi, mpe vumbulaka ndumba ya kufwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Lke 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu vutukaka na simu ya nkaka ya dyanga, mpe nkonga ya bantu vukanaka pene-pene ya yandi. Yandi vwandaka na kumu ya maza. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Zayuse, mosi na kati ya bamfumu ya yinzo ya lusambulu ya ba-Zwife kwizaka kuna. Ntangu yandi talaka Yesu, yandi fukamaka na ntwala ya Yesu, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />mpe tatamanaka na kulomba Yesu na kutuba: «Mwana ya munu ya kento kele pene-pene na lufwa. Kwiza kutula yandi maboko samu ti yandi vuuka mpe zinga.» <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yesu kwendaka kintwadi na Zayuse. Nkonga ya nene ya bantu landaka Yesu, mpe vwandaka fyetikisa yandi na balweka nyonso.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ya vwandaka na kati ya nkonga yina, na kento mosi yina vwandaka basika menga katuka bamvula kumi na zole. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Yandi talaka mpasi ya kulutila na sika ya minganga mingi. Yandi manisaka mbongo nyonso ya yandi, mpe yandi belukaka ve. Kasi mpasi vwandaka lutila. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Yandi kuwaka mambu yina bantu vwandaka zonza na Nkumbu ya Yesu. Na yina, yandi kwendaka na manima ya Yesu na kati ya nkonga, mpe simbaka kinkuti ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Yandi vwandaka tuba na kati ya ntima: «Kana mu simba kaka kinkuti ya yandi, mu ke beluka.» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Kaka na ntangu yina, menga bikaka na kubasika, mpe yandi zabaka ti yandi belukaka na kimbevo yina. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Yesu zabaka mbangu ti ngolo basikaka na nzutu ya yandi. Yandi balukaka na sika ya nkonga, mpe yufulaka: «Nani me simba kinkuti ya munu?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Bilandi ya yandi vutulaka: «Nge ke na kutala mbote ti bantu ke na kufyetikisa nge, mpe nge ke na kuyufula dyaka: “Nani me simba munu?” » <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Kasi Yesu talaka na balweka nyonso samu na kuzaba nani salaka mutindu yina. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Kento yina vwandaka tekita na boma samu ti yandi zabaka mambu yina kuminaka yandi. Na yina, yandi kwendaka fukama na mantwala ya Yesu, mpe tubaka butsyelika. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu zabisaka yandi: «Mwana ya munu, kiminu ya nge me vuukisa nge. Kwenda na kizunu, mpe beluka na kimbevo ya nge.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Ntete Yesu manisa na kuzonza, bantu yina katukaka na yinzo ya Zayuse kwizaka mpe tubaka: «Mwana ya nge me kufwa. Kukwamisa dyaka ve Mulongisi.» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Kasi Yesu talaka yawu mpamba, mpe tubaka na Zayuse: «Kuvwanda na boma ve, kwikila kaka.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Na yina, Yesu yiminaka bantu na kukwenda na yandi. Yandi nataka kaka Pyele, Zaki, mpe Yowane, leki ya Zaki. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ntangu bawu kumaka na yinzo ya Zayuse, Yesu talaka bantu yina vwandaka kufwa nzutu na kudila mpe kulooka na ngolo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Yesu kotaka na yinzo mpe zabisaka bawu: «Samu na yinki beno ke na kusala makelele mpe beno ke na kudila! Mwana me kufwa ve. Yandi ke na kulala.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Kasi bantu vwandaka seka yandi. Na yina, yandi basisaka bawu nyonso na ngaanda. Yandi bakaka tata na mama ya ndumba yina, mpe kintwadi na bilandi tatu ya yandi, bawu kotaka na kivinga ya mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesu simbaka mwana na diboko, mpe tubaka: «Talita kume», ya zola kutuba «Mwana ya kento, mu ke na kuzabisa nge, vumbuka!» <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Na mpamukunu, mwana telamaka mpe tambulaka. (Yandi vwandaka na bamvula kumi na zole.) Na kutala mutindu yina, bawu nyonso yitukaka mingi. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Kasi Yesu yiminaka bawu na ngolo nyonso na kutuba yawu ve na muntu. Na manima, yandi zabisaka bawu na kupesa ndumba yina madya.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bantu ya Nazaleti mangaka na kukwikila na Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Lke 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu katukaka na kisika yina, mpe kwendaka na mbanza yina yandi kulaka. Bilandi ya yandi mpe kwendaka na yandi. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Na kilumbu ya saba, yandi vwandaka longisa na yinzo ya lusambulu ya ba-Zwife. Bantu mingi yina vwandaka kuwa yandi yitukaka mingi, mpe tubaka: «Wapi sika yandi me kuzwa mambu nyonso yayi? Nani me pesa yandi ndwenga yayi, mpe lulendo ya kusala bimangu ya mutindu yayi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Yandi kele kisadi-mabaya mpe mwana ya Maliya. Yandi kele yaya ya Zaki, Yoze, Yude mpe Simoni! Bibusi ya yandi ke zingaka na beto awa!» Mambu nyonso yina bawu vwandaka banza salaka ti bawu kwikila na yandi ve. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Na yina, Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Ba ke zitisaka <char style="w">mumbikudi</char> bisika nyonso. Kasi ba ke zitisaka yandi ve na mbanza ya yandi, na dikanda ya yandi mpe na dibuta ya yandi.»<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Kuna, Yesu lendaka ve na kusala kimangu, kana kaka ve mwa bambevo yina yandi tentikaka maboko mpe belusaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yandi vwandaka yituka samu ti bantu ya mbanza ya yandi vwandaka kwikila ve.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Kisalu ya bilandi kumi na zole</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Lke 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Na manima, Yesu vwandaka zyeta na babwala ya pene-pene na mbanza yina samu na kulongisa bantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Yandi bokilaka bilandi ya yandi kumi na zole, mpe fidisaka bawu zole-zole. Yandi pesaka bawu lulendo ya kubingisa bampeve ya yimbi, <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />mpe zabisaka bawu mutindu yayi: «Beno nata ata kima samu na nzyetolo ya beno. Beno nata kaka mwa yinti. Beno nata ve mampa, to nkutu, to mbongo na baposi. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Beno lwata mapapa, kasi beno nata ve binkuti zole.» <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Yandi zabisaka dyaka bawu: «Na mbanza yina beno ke kuma, beno vwanda na kati ya yinzo yina ba ke yamba beno tii ntangu beno ke katuka kuna. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Kana bantu ya bwala mosi yamba beno ve to manga na kuwa beno, beno katuka kuna mpe beno ningisa fundu-fundu ya makulu ya beno. Ya ke vwanda nkebosolo samu na bawu.»<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Na yina, bilandi kwendaka mpe vwandaka zabisa bantu nyonso na kusoba nkadulu. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Bawu bingisaka bampeve mingi ya yimbi. Bawu vwandaka tula bambevo mingi mafuta na yintu, mpe vwandaka belusa bawu.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa ya Yowane Mubotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Lke 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Ntinu Elode kuwaka nsangu ya Yesu samu ti nsangu ya Yesu mwanganaka na bisika nyonso. Ba ya nkaka vwandaka tuba: «Yowane Mubotiki me vumbuka na lufwa! Ni yawu yina, yandi kele na lulendo ya kusala bimangu.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Kasi ba ya nkaka vwandaka tuba: «Ya kele Eli.» Ba ya nkaka dyaka vwandaka tuba: «Yandi kele mosi na kati ya mimbikudi ya ntama.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ntangu Elode kuwaka mambu nyonso yina bantu vwandaka zonza, yandi tubaka: «Ya kele Yowane Mubotiki yina mu zengisaka yintu. Ni yandi me vumbuka na lufwa!»<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Ya tsyelika, Elode kangisaka Yowane, mpe tulaka yandi na boloko na bisengo na makulu. Yandi salaka mutindu yina samu na Elodyade, kento ya mpangi ya yandi Filipe, yina yandi kwelaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Ni yawu yina, Yowane zabisaka na Elode ti: «Nge kele ve na muswa ya kubaka kento ya mpangi ya nge<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:16">Knz 18.16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20.21</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Elodyade vwandaka ya kufuluka na nkele na Yowane, mpe vwandaka zola kufwa yandi. Kasi yandi vwandaka lenda ve, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />samu ti Elode vwandaka na boma ya Yowane. Elode zabaka ti Yowane vwandaka muntu ya <char style="w">kudedama</char> mpe ya longo. Ni yawu yina, yandi vwandaka keba yandi. Mabanza ya yandi vwandaka kuma kidi-kidi ntangu yandi vwandaka kuwa Yowane. Kasi yandi vwandaka zola kuwa mambu ya Yowane.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Kasi Elodyade kuzwaka ntangu ya mbote na kilumbu yina Elode salaka <char style="w">mukembo</char> ya yandi ya mbutukulu. Elode bokilaka na kudya bamfumu ya luyalu ya yandi, bamfumu ya binwani, mpe bantu ya mfunu ya Ngalili. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Ndumba ya Elodyade kotaka na kivinga ya <char style="w">mukembo</char>, mpe binaka. Yandi yangidikaka Elode mpe banzenza. Na yina, ntinu tubaka na ndumba yina: «Mu ke pesa nge kima ni kima yina nge ke lomba munu.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Na manima, yandi zengaka ndefi yayi: «Mu ke pesa nge nyonso yina nge ke lomba munu, ata ya vwanda ndambu ya yinsi ya munu.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Ndumba basikaka mpe yufulaka mama ya yandi: «Yinki mu fwana kulomba?» Mama ya yandi vutulaka: «Lomba yintu ya Yowane Mubotiki.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ndumba vutukaka na nswalu nyonso na sika ya ntinu, mpe tubaka: «Mu zola ti nge pesa munu malu-malu yayi yintu ya Yowane Mubotiki na kati ya ndonga.»<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Ntinu Elode kumaka na kyadi. Kasi samu na ndefi yina yandi kudyaka na ntwala ya banzenza, yandi lendaka ve na kuyimina yandi yawu. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Na yina, yandi tumisaka mbulu-mbulu na nswalu nyonso na kunatina yandi yintu ya Yowane. Mbulu-mbulu kwendaka na kati ya boloko, mpe zengaka Yowane yintu. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Yandi nataka yintu yina na kati ya ndonga, mpe pesaka yawu na ndumba. Ndumba pesaka yawu na mama ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Ntangu bilandi ya Yowane kuwaka nsangu yina, bawu kwendaka baka nzutu ya Yowane mpe tulaka yawu na kati ya ndyamu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu dikilaka bantu mafunda tanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lke 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yne 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Bantumwa vutukaka na sika ya Yesu, mpe zabisaka yandi mambu nyonso yina bawu salaka mpe longisaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Yesu tubaka na <char style="w">bantumwa</char>: «Beno kwiza na munu na kisika yina kele bantu ve samu na kupema fyoti.» Yandi zonzaka mutindu yina samu ti bantu mingi vwandaka kwiza mpe kwenda, mpe <char style="w">bantumwa</char> kuzwaka ve mwa ntangu ya kudya.<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Na yina, bawu kotaka na bwatu, mpe kwendaka na yinsi ya kuyuma, kisika yina vwandaka ve na bantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Kasi bantu mingi talaka bawu ntangu bawu kwendaka, mpe zabaka bawu. Na yina, bawu katukaka na bambanza nyonso yina vwandaka pene-pene, mpe tekilaka na makulu na kisika yina Yesu mpe <char style="w">bantumwa</char> vwandaka kwenda. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ntangu Yesu basikaka na bwatu, yandi talaka nkonga ya nene ya bantu. Yandi kumaka ya kufuluka na kyadi samu na bawu, samu ti bawu vwandaka mutindu mameme yina kele ve na muvungi. Na yina, yandi bandaka na kulongisa bawu mambu mingi.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Mutindu bwisi bandaka na kuyila, bilandi ya Yesu kwendaka pene-pene ya yandi, mpe tubaka: «Bwisi me banda na kuyila, mpe kisika yayi kele na kima ve. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Vutula bantu yayi na babwala mpe bayinzo ya mivungi yina kele pene-pene, samu ti bawu sumba bima ya kudya.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yesu vutulaka: «Beno pesa bawu madya beno mosi.» Kasi bawu yufulaka yandi: «Nge zola ti beto kwenda kusumba mampa yina me fwanana na Badenalya bankama zole (200)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:28">Mat 18.28</ref></char></note>, mpe beto pesa bawu yawu?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Beno kwenda tala mampa yikwa kele na beno?» Bawu kwendaka tala mpe tubaka: «Beto kele na mampa tanu na bambisi zole.»<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Na yina, Yesu tumisaka bilandi ya yandi na kukabula bantu nyonso na mwa bankonga, mpe na kuvwandisa bawu na zulu ya mwa matiti yina vwandaka kuna. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Bantu vwandaka na bankonga. Ya vwandaka na bankonga ya bantu nkama, mpe bankonga ya bantu makumi tanu. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Na manima, Yesu bakaka mampa tanu mpe bambisi zole. Yandi talaka na zulu mpe tondaka Nzambi. Yandi bukunaka mampa mpe pesaka yawu na bilandi ya yandi, samu ti bawu kabula yawu na bantu nyonso. Yandi kabulaka mpe bambisi zole yina na bantu nyonso. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Bawu nyonso kudyaka mpe yukutaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Bilandi lokotaka bibuku ya mampa mpe ya bambisi yina bikanaka. Bawu fulusaka bitunga kumi na zole. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Lutangu ya bayina kudyaka mampa vwandaka mafunda tanu (5 000) ya babakala.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tambulaka na zulu ya maza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yne 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Na manima, Yesu tumisaka bilandi ya yandi na kukota na bwatu, samu ti bawu tekila na simu ya nkaka ya dyanga na ndambu ya mbanza Besayida ntangu yandi mosi ke vutula bantu na bambanza ya bawu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Na manima ya kuvutula nkonga yina, yandi kwendaka na mongo samu na kusambila. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ntangu mpimpa kumaka, bwatu vwandaka me kuma na kati-kati ya dyanga, mpe Yesu vwandaka kaka yandi mosi na ntoto. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Yesu talaka ti bilandi ya yandi vwandaka tala mpasi na kunata bwatu, samu ti kitembo ya ngolo vwandaka bwabana bawu. Na yina, ntete bwisi kutsya, yandi tambulaka na zulu ya maza na kukwenda na sika ya bawu, mpe zolaka luta bawu. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ntangu bilandi talaka yandi na kutambula na zulu ya maza, bawu banzaka ti ya vwandaka mukuyu, mpe bawu bandaka na kulooka. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Ya tsyelika, bawu nyonso vwandaka tala yandi, mpe kumaka na boma. Kasi yandi zabisaka bawu na mbangu: «Beno vwanda na kibakala! Ya kele munu. Beno tala boma ve.» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Na manima, Yesu kotaka na bwatu yina, mpe mupepe dingamaka. Na yina, bilandi yitukaka mingi. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Ya tsyelika, bilandi bakulaka ve kimangu ya mampa samu ti bantima ya bawu vwandaka ya kukangama.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu belusaka bambevo na kizunga ya Ngenezaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Na manima ya kusabuka dyanga, bawu kumaka na kizunga ya Ngenezalete. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ntangu bawu vwandaka basika na bwatu, bantu zabaka Yesu mbangu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Na yina, bantu kwendaka mbangu na kati ya kizunga nyonso, mpe natinaka yandi bambevo na zulu ya bipoyi konso kisika yina bawu vwandaka kuwa ti Yesu kele. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Na bisika nyonso yina Yesu vwandaka luta na kati ya babwala, bambanza, mpe babwala ya mivungi, bantu vwandaka tula bambevo na bisika yina bantu nyonso ke vukanaka. Bawu vwandaka bondila yandi na kupesa bambevo muswa ya kusimba kwandi nsongi ya kinkuti ya yandi, mpe bayina nyonso vwandaka simba yawu, vwandaka beluka.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Dyambu ya kinkulu ya bankooko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />
    <char style="w">Ba-Falisye</char> mpe mwa ndambu ya milongisi ya Misiku katukaka na Yelusalemi mpe vukana na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Bawu talaka ti bilandi ya nkaka ya Yesu vwandaka kudya na maboko ya <char style="w">kuvedila</char> ve. Ya zola kutuba ti ata kusukula maboko.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Ya tsyelika, <char style="w">ba-Falisye</char> mpe ba-Zwife nyonso ya nkaka ke zitisaka kinkulu ya bankooko ya bawu. Ntete na kudya bawu ke sukulaka mbote maboko ya bawu. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ntangu bawu ke katukaka na kisika yina bantu mingi ke yonzamaka, bawu ke kudyaka ve kana bawu me yobila ntete ve. Bawu ke zitisaka mpe misiku mingi ya nkaka ya kinkulu ya bawu mutindu: kusukula mbote bambungu, banzungu ya ntoto, mpe bandonga ya bisengo.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Na yina, <char style="w">ba-Falisye</char> mpe milongisi ya Misiku yufulaka Yesu: «Samu na yinki bilandi ya nge ke zitisaka ve kinkulu ya bankooko ya beto? Bawu ke kudyaka na maboko ya <char style="w">kuvedila</char> ve!» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu vutulaka: «Beno kele bantu ya bantima zole! Esaya tubaka mambu ya tsyelika ntangu yandi bikulaka samu na beno:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">«“Bantu yayi ke zitisaka munu kaka na bikoba ya bawu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">Kasi na bantima ya bawu, bawu kele ntama na munu.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Balusambulu ya bawu kele ya mpamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">samu ti bandongosolo ya bawu kele kaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">misiku yina ke katukaka na bantu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Esa 29.13</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Yesu zabisaka dyaka bawu: «Beno ke bikaka misiku ya Nzambi samu na kuzitisa kinkulu ya bantu.»<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu zabisaka dyaka bawu: «Beno mangaka <char style="w">Musiku</char> ya Nzambi samu na kuvwanda ya kukangama na kinkulu ya beno. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Ni Moyize tubaka: “Zitisa tata na mama ya nge”, mpe “Ba fwana kufwa muntu yina ke finga tata to mama ya yandi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kbk 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:7">21.7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Knz 20.9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Mus 5.16</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Kasi beno, beno ke tubaka ti muntu lenda kutuba na tata to mama ya yandi: «“Bima yina mu zolaka pesa nge samu na kusadisa nge, kele Kolobane” (ya zola kutuba: munkayulu yina mu ke pesa na Nzambi). <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Beno ke pesaka yandi muswa ya kusadisa dyaka ve tata to mama ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Na mutindu yina, beno ke kangisaka muntu nzila na kuzitisa tata to mama ya yandi. Beno ke manisaka Mambu ya Nzambi mfunu samu na kusadila kinkulu ya beno.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mambu yina ke salaka ti muntu vwanda ve ya <char style="w">kuvedila</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Na manima, Yesu bokilaka dyaka nkonga ya bantu, mpe tubaka: «Beno kuwa munu beno nyonso, mpe beno bakula mambu yayi: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Ata kima ya ngaanda yina ke kotaka na nzutu ya muntu ke salaka ti yandi kuvwanda ve ya <char style="w">kuvedila</char>. Kasi ni nyonso yina ke basikaka na nzutu ya muntu ke salaka ti yandi vwanda ve ya <char style="w">kuvedila</char>. [ <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Kana muntu kele na makutu, yandi kuwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na babibiliya ya nkaka ya ntama, kitini yayi, ba bwelaka yawu na kubwela</char></note>.]»<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ntangu Yesu bikaka nkonga ya bantu, mpe vutukaka na yinzo, bilandi ya yandi yufulaka yandi nsasa ya kingana yina. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yesu tubaka: «Beno mpe, beno ke na mayela ve? Beno zaba ti bima nyonso yina ke kotaka na nzutu ya muntu lenda kusumuna yandi ve. <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Yawu ke kotaka ve na ntima ya muntu, kasi na kivumu ya yandi. Na manima, yawu ke basikaka.» Na kutuba mutindu yina, Yesu lakisaka ti madya nyonso kele ya <char style="w">kuvedila</char>. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yesu tubaka dyaka: «Ni nyonso yina ke basikaka na nzutu ya muntu ke salaka ti muntu vwanda ve ya <char style="w">kuvedila</char>. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Ya tsyelika, ni na ntima ya muntu ke katukaka mabanza ya yimbi yina ke nataka muntu na kuzinga na kindumba, na kulaba, na kufwa bampangi, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />na kusala kinsuza, na kuvwanda na bansatu ya kubaka bima ya bampangi, na kuvwanda na myangu, na kuvuna bampangi, na kuzinga kidi-kidi, na kuvwanda na musoki, na kuzonza yimbi ya bampangi, na kuvwanda na lunangu, mpe na kuvwanda na ntima ngolo. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Mambu nyonso yayi ya yimbi ke katukaka na ntima ya muntu, mpe ke salaka ti muntu kuvwanda ya <char style="w">kuvedila</char> ve.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kento mosi ya nzenza kwikilaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu katukaka kuna, mpe yandi kwendaka na kizunga ya Tile. Yandi kotaka na yinzo mosi, mpe vwandaka zola ve ti bantu zaba ti yandi vwandaka kuna, kasi yandi lembanaka na kubumbama. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Kaka na ntangu yina, kento mosi yina mwana vwandaka na mpeve ya yimbi kuwaka nsangu ya Yesu. Yandi kwendaka sika vwandaka Yesu, mpe fukamaka na ntwala ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Kento yango vwandaka ve Zwife. Yandi vwandaka muntu ya mbanza Finisi ya kizunga ya Sili. Yandi lombaka Yesu na kubingisa mpeve ya yimbi yina vwandaka na mwana ya yandi ya kento. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Kasi Yesu zabisaka yandi: «Bika bana kuyukuta ntete, samu ti ya kele mbote ve na kubaka madya ya bana ya fyoti, mpe kulosa yawu na bayimbwa.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Kento vutulaka: «<char style="w">Mfumu</char>! Ya kele ya tsyelika. Kasi bayimbwa na yisi ya mesa ke kudyaka bibuku ya mampa yina bana ke bwisaka!» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Na yina, Yesu zabisaka yandi: «Samu na mvutu yina nge me pesa, nge lenda kuvutuka ya nge na yinzo. Mpeve ya yimbi me basika na nzutu ya mwana ya nge.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Kento vutukaka na yinzo ya yandi, mpe kutaka mwana ya yandi ya kuvumbuka na mfulu. Yandi vwandaka dyaka ve na mpeve ya yimbi.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu belusaka dibaba ya makutu ya kufwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Na manima, Yesu katukaka na mbanza Tile. Yandi lutaka na mbanza Sidone, mpe vutukaka pene-pene na dyanga ya Ngalili na kulutila na kizunga ya Bambanza-Kumi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ba natinaka yandi muntu yina vwandaka na makutu ya kufwa, mpe vwandaka zonza mbote ve. Ba lombaka Yesu na kutentikila yandi maboko. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Na yina, Yesu nataka yandi mwa ntama ya kisika yina vwandaka nkonga. Yandi tulaka yandi misapi na makutu, lobolaka mante na misapi, mpe simbaka yandi ludimi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Na manima, Yesu talaka na zulu, pemaka na ngolo nyonso, mpe tubaka na muntu yina: «Efata» (yina zola kutuba: funguka)! <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Kaka na ntangu yina, makutu ya muntu yango fungukaka, ludimi ya yandi nyangukaka, mpe yandi bandaka na kuzonza mbote. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu yiminaka bawu na kutuba yawu na muntu. Kasi mutindu yandi vwandaka lutila na kuyimina bawu, bawu vwandaka lutila mpe na kumwangisa nsangu. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Bantu yitukaka mingi, mpe vwandaka tuba: «Mambu nyonso yina yandi ke salaka kele mbote! Yandi ke na kufungula makutu ya bantu yina ke kuwaka ve, mpe ke na kuzonzisa mababa.»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu dikilaka bantu mafunda yiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Kilumbu ya nkaka, nkonga ya bantu vukanaka dyaka. Mutindu bawu vwandaka ve na kima ya kudya, Yesu bokilaka bilandi ya yandi mpe zabisaka bawu: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Mu ke na kutala bantu yayi kyadi samu ti ya me kuma bilumbu tatu yina bawu kele na munu awa, mpe bawu ke dyaka ve na kima ya kudya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Kana mu vutula bawu na babwala ya bawu ata kudya kima, bawu ke vwanda ya kulemba na nzila, samu ti mingi na kati ya bawu me katuka ntama.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Bilandi vutulaka: «Wapi sika beto lenda kuzwa madya na kisika yayi kele na kima ve samu na kuyukutisa bantu nyonso yayi?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu yufulaka bawu: «Beno kele na mampa yikwa?» Bawu vutulaka: «Beto kele na mampa nsambwadi.»<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Na yina, Yesu tumisaka bantu nyonso na kuvwanda na ntoto. Yandi bakaka mampa nsambwadi, mpe na manima ya kutonda Nzambi, yandi bukunaka yawu mpe pesaka yawu na bilandi samu na kukabula yawu na bantu nyonso. Bilandi bakaka yawu mpe kabulaka. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Bawu vwandaka mpe na mwa bambisi ya fyoti. Yesu tondaka Nzambi samu na bambisi yina, mpe tubaka na bilandi ya yandi na kukabula yawu mpe. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Bantu nyonso kudyaka mpe yukutaka. Bilandi lokotaka mwa bandambu yina bikanaka, mpe bawu fulusaka bitunga nsambwadi. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Bayina vwandaka kuna, vwandaka keba ve mafunda yiya (4 000), mpe Yesu vutulaka bawu. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Yandi kotaka nswalu na bwatu na bilandi ya yandi, mpe kwendaka na kizunga ya Dalemanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba-Falisye lombaka Yesu na kusala kidimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat 16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />
    <char style="w">Ba-Falisye</char> kwizaka na sika ya Yesu, mpe bandaka na kusolola na yandi samu na kulebika yandi mutambu. Bawu lombaka yandi na kusala kidimbu yina ke lakisa ti yandi katukaka na sika ya Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu pemaka na ngolo nyonso, mpe tubaka: «Samu na yinki bantu ya ntangu yayi ke na kulomba kidimbu? Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kuzabisa beno: Ata kidimbu ke salama samu na bawu.» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Na manima, yandi bikaka bawu. Yandi kotaka dyaka na bwatu, mpe kwendaka na simu ya nkaka ya dyanga.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Beno sala keba na ndongosolo ya <char style="w">ba-Falisye</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Bilandi zimbanaka na kunata mampa. Kaka dimpa mosi vwandaka na bawu na kati ya bwatu. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu kebisaka bawu mutindu yayi: «Beno vwanda na mayela! Beno sala keba na levule ya <char style="w">ba-Falisye</char> mpe ya Elode.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Bilandi bandaka na kutuba bawu na bawu samu ti bawu vwandaka ve na mampa. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu zabaka mambu yina bawu vwandaka solola, mpe yufulaka bawu: «Samu na yinki beno ke na kutuba ti beno kele ve na mampa? Nabunu beno bakula? Nabunu beno vwanda na mayela? Bantima ya beno ke ntete ya kukangama? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Beno kele na meso, kasi beno ke na kutala ve. Beno kele na makutu, kasi beno ke na kuwa ve. Beno bambuka moyo: <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Ntangu mu bukunaka mampa tanu samu na babakala mafunda tanu (5 000), bitunga yikwa beno fulusaka na bibuku yina bikanaka?» Bawu vutulaka: «Bitunga kumi na zole.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Yesu tubaka dyaka: «Ntangu mu bukunaka mampa nsambwadi samu na bantu mafunda yiya (4 000), bitunga yikwa beno fulusaka?» Bawu vutulaka: «Bitunga nsambwadi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Na yina, Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Beno ke na kubakula ntete ve?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu belusaka mpofo na mbanza Besayida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu na bilandi ya yandi kumaka na mbanza Besayida. Ba natinaka Yesu mpofo mosi, mpe bawu lombaka Yesu na kusimba yandi. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu simbaka mpofo na diboko, mpe basisaka yandi na bwala. Na manima, Yesu tulaka yandi mante na meso. Yandi tentikaka mpofo maboko mpe yufulaka yandi: «Nge ke na kutala kima?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Mpofo zibulaka meso, mpe tubaka: «Mu ke na kutala bantu. Mu ke na kutala bawu mutindu bayinti, kasi bawu ke na kutambula.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu tentikaka dyaka yandi maboko na meso, mpe muntu yina talaka mbote. Yandi belukaka, mpe vwandaka tala bima nyonso na pwelele nyonso. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Na yina, Yesu vutulaka yandi na yinzo ya yandi, mpe tubaka: «Kukota ve na bwala.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyele tubaka ti Yesu kele <char style="w">Masiya</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lke 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu na bilandi ya yandi kwendaka na babwala yina kele pene-pene na mbanza <char style="w">Sezale</char> ya Filipe. Na nzila, yandi yufulaka bawu: «Yinki bantu ke na kutuba samu na munu?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bilandi vutulaka: «Bawu ke na kutuba ti nge kele Yowane Mubotiki. Ba ya nkaka ke na kutuba ti nge kele Eli, mpe ba ya nkaka dyaka ti nge kele mosi na kati ya mimbikudi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yesu yufulaka dyaka bawu: «Kasi na beno, mu kele nani?» Pyele vutulaka: «Nge kele <char style="w">Masiya</char>.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Na yina, Yesu yiminaka bawu na kutuba yawu na muntu.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu zabisaka lufwa mpe mvumbukulu ya yandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16.21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lke 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Na manima, Yesu pesaka ndongosolo yayi na bilandi ya yandi: «Mwana ya Muntu fwana kutala mpasi mingi. Bakuluntu, bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>, mpe milongisi ya Misiku ke manga yandi. Ba ke kufwa yandi, mpe yandi ke vumbuka na lufwa na kilumbu ya tatu.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yandi zabisaka bawu yawu na pwelele nyonso. Na yina, Pyele nataka yandi na lweka, mpe bandaka na kusemba yandi. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Kasi Yesu balukaka, talaka bilandi ya yandi, mpe sembaka Pyele na kutuba: «Katuka pene-pene ya munu, <char style="w">Satana</char>, samu ti mabanza ya nge kele ve mabanza ya Nzambi, kasi ya bantu.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Na manima, Yesu bokilaka nkonga ya bantu mpe bilandi ya yandi. Yandi zabisaka bawu: «Kana muntu zola kulanda munu, yandi bika na kubanza na mambu yina me tadila yandi mosi. Kasi yandi nata kulunsi ya yandi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16.24</ref></char></note>, mpe yandi landa munu. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ya tsyelika, muntu yina ke zola kuvuukisa luzingu ya yandi, ke bebisa yawu. Kasi muntu yina ke bebisa luzingu ya yandi samu na munu mpe samu na Nsangu ya Mbote, ke vuukisa yawu. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Wapi mfunu kele na muntu na kuvwanda na bimvwama nyonso ya yinza kana yandi ke na kubebisa luzingu ya yandi? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Wapi kima muntu lenda kupesa na kusumba luzingu ya yandi? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Kana muntu tala nsoni samu na munu mpe samu na mambu ya munu na ntwala ya bantu ya ntangu yayi yina kele misumuki mpe ya kukwikama ve na Nzambi, Mwana ya Muntu mpe ke tala yandi nsoni ntangu yandi ke vutuka na <char style="w">bambazi</char> ya yandi ya longo na kati ya nkembo ya Tata ya yandi.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu zabisaka dyaka bawu: «Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kuzabisa beno, bantu ya nkaka yina kele awa ke kufwa ve tii ntangu bawu ke tala <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char> yina ke kwiza na lulendo.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luzabusu ya <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lke 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Na manima ya bilumbu sambanu, Yesu bakaka Pyele, Zaki, mpe Yowane. Yandi nataka bawu na zulu ya mongo ya yinda kisika yina bawu vwandaka kaka bawu mosi. Na ntwala ya bawu, Yesu sobaka kifwani ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Binkuti ya yandi lezimaka mpe kumaka mpembe ya kulutila. Ata muntu na ntoto ya muvimba lendaka kumisa kinkuti mpembe ya mutindu yina. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Na mpamukunu, bilandi tatu talaka Eli mpe Moyize yina vwandaka zonza na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Na yina, Pyele tubaka na Yesu: «<char style="w">Mfumu</char>, ya kele mbote ti beto vwanda awa. Beto ke yidika bayinzo tatu ya lele: yinzo mosi ke vwanda ya nge, ya nkaka ke vwanda ya Moyize, mpe ya nkaka dyaka ya Eli.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Ya tsyelika, Pyele vwandaka zaba ve yinki yandi ke tuba samu ti bilandi nyonso tatu vwandaka na boma mingi. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Na mpamukunu, dituti kwizaka mpe fukaka bawu. Ndinga wakanaka na kati ya dituti, mpe tubaka: «Yandi yayi, ni Mwana ya munu yina mu ke zolaka mingi. Beno kuwa yandi!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Kaka na ntangu yina, bilandi talaka na bisika nyonso. Kasi bawu talaka dyaka ve muntu ya nkaka. Bawu talaka kaka Yesu yina vwandaka kintwadi na bawu. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ntangu bawu vwandaka kulumuka mongo, Yesu yiminaka bawu na kuzabisa na bantu mambu yina bawu talaka tii ntangu Mwana ya Muntu ke vumbuka na lufwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Bawu tumamaka na mambu yina yandi zabisaka bawu. Kasi bawu vwandaka yufula bawu na bawu: «Yinki zola kutuba kuvumbuka na lufwa?» <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Na manima, bilandi yufulaka Yesu: «Samu na yinki milongisi ya Misiku ke tubaka ti Eli fwana kukwiza ntete?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu vutulaka: «Ya tsyelika, Eli fwana kukwiza ntete samu na kusungika mambu nyonso. Kasi samu na yinki ba sonikaka ti Mwana ya Muntu ke tala mpasi mingi, mpe ba ke nyokola yandi? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Kasi mu ke na kuzabisa beno ti Eli kwizaka yimeni, mpe bantu salaka yandi mambu nyonso yina bawu zolaka mutindu yawu kele ya kusonama na Dibuku ya Nzambi samu na yandi.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu belusaka mwana yina vwandaka na mpeve ya yimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17.14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Lke 9.37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ntangu bawu kumaka na kisika yina vwandaka bilandi ya nkaka, bawu talaka nkonga ya nene ya bantu yina zungaka bilandi yina, mpe milongisi ya Misiku yina vwandaka solola na bawu. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ntangu bantu talaka Yesu, bawu yitukaka mingi, mpe bawu kimaka na sika ya yandi samu na kupesa yandi mbote. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu yufulaka bilandi ya yandi: «Wapi mambu beno ke na kusolola na bawu?»<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Muntu mosi na kati ya nkonga vutulaka: «<char style="w">Mfumu</char>, mu me natina nge mwana ya munu. Yandi kele na mpeve ya yimbi yina ke na kukumisa yandi dibaba. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Mpeve ya yimbi yina ke kwamisaka yandi kisika ni kisika, mpe ke losaka yandi na ntoto. Yandi ke basisaka mafulu na yinwa, ke kwetisaka meno, mpe nzutu ya yandi ke kumaka ngolo. Mu me lomba bilandi ya nge na kubingisa mpeve yango, kasi bawu me lenda ve.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu tubaka: «Beno bantu ya ntangu yayi! Beno kele bantu yina kele ve na kiminu! Tii wapi ntangu mu ke vwanda kaka na beno? Tii wapi ntangu mu ke vibidila beno? Beno nata yandi awa.»<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Na yina, bawu natinaka yandi mwana yango. Ntangu mpeve ya yimbi talaka Yesu, yawu ningisaka mwana na ngolo nyonso, mpe mwana kubwaka na ntoto. Mwana vwandaka vindumuka, mpe mafulu vwandaka basika yandi na yinwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu yufulaka tata ya mwana yina: «Ya me kuma bamvula yikwa yawu ke kwamisaka yandi?» Tata vutulaka: «Yawu ke kwamisaka yandi katuka bumwana ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Konso ntangu, mpeve ya yimbi ke losaka yandi na tiya to na maza samu na kufwa yandi. Kana nge lenda kusala kima, sadisa beto mpe tala beto kyadi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu vutulaka: «Nge me tuba ti kana mu lenda kusala kima. Kasi zaba ti mambu nyonso ke salamaka na muntu yina ke kwikilaka.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Kaka na ntangu yina, tata ya mwana lookaka: «Mu ke na kukwikila. Sadisa munu samu ti mu kele muntu ya kiminu ya fyoti.» <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Ntangu Yesu talaka ti nkonga ya bantu vwandaka kwiza mbangu kisika yina bawu vwandaka, yandi tumisaka mpeve ya yimbi na ngolo, mpe tubaka: «Mpeve yina ke kufwaka makutu mpe ke kangaka ndinga, basika na nzutu ya mwana yayi, mpe kuvutuka dyaka ve.» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Mpeve ya yimbi lookaka, ningisaka mwana na ngolo nyonso, mpe basikaka. Mwana kumaka mutindu muntu ya kufwa, mpe bantu mingi vwandaka tuba ti yandi me kufwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Kasi Yesu simbaka mwana na diboko. Yandi telemisaka mwana, mpe mwana telamaka.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ntangu Yesu vutukaka na yinzo, bilandi yufulaka yandi na kisika ya bawu mosi: «Samu na yinki beto me lenda ve na kubingisa mpeve yina?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu vutulaka: «Kaka na lusambulu beno lenda kubingisa mpeve ya mutindu yina.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu zabisaka dyaka lufwa mpe mvumbukulu ya yandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Lke 9.43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Bawu katukaka kuna mpe sabukaka Ngalili. Yesu zolaka ve ti bantu kuzaba kisika yandi vwandaka. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Yandi vwandaka longisa bilandi ya yandi mutindu yayi: «Ba ke yekula Mwana ya Muntu na maboko ya bantu. Ba ke kufwa yandi, mpe na kilumbu ya tatu, yandi ke vumbuka na lufwa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Kasi bilandi bakulaka ve mambu yina, mpe bawu vwandaka na boma ya kuyufula yandi.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nani kele muntu ya mfunu na <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char>?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lke 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Yesu na bilandi ya yandi kwendaka na mbanza Kapenawume. Ntangu bawu kumaka na yinzo, Yesu yufulaka bawu: «Wapi mambu beno vwandaka solola na nzila?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Kasi bawu vutulaka ve mvutu, samu ti na nzila bawu vwandaka solola bawu na bawu samu na kuzaba nani me lutila mfunu na kati ya bawu. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Na yina, Yesu kwendaka vwanda. Yandi bokilaka bilandi kumi na zole, mpe zabisaka bawu: «Muntu yina zola kuvwanda muntu ya ntete, fwana kuvwanda muntu ya nsuka mpe kisadi ya bantu nyonso.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Na manima, Yesu bakaka mwana ya fyoti mpe tulaka yandi na kati-kati ya bawu. Yandi tulaka yandi na kati ya maboko ya yandi, mpe tubaka: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Muntu yina ke yamba mwana ya fyoti ya mutindu yayi na Nkumbu ya munu, ke yamba munu mosi. Na yina, muntu yina ke yamba munu, ke yamba munu ve, kasi yandi ke yamba muntu yina fidisaka munu.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muntu yina ke salaka ve beto yimbi, kele na ndambu ya beto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Lke 9.49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yowane tubilaka yandi: «<char style="w">Mfumu</char>, beto talaka muntu yina vwandaka bingisa bampeve ya yimbi na Nkumbu ya nge. Beto zolaka yimina yandi na kusala yawu samu ti yandi kele ve na kati ya nkonga ya beto yina ke na kulanda nge.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Kasi Yesu vutulaka: «Beno yimina yandi ve, samu ti ata muntu lenda kusala kimangu na Nkumbu ya munu, mpe na manima yandi tonga munu. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Muntu yina ke yinaka beno ve, kele nkundi ya beno. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kuzabisa beno: Konso muntu yina ke pesa beno kopo ya maza samu ti beno kele bantu ya <char style="w">Klisto</char>, ke kondwa ve na kuzwa musendo ya yandi.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Lke 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />«Kana muntu bwisa na disumu mwana mosi na kati ya bana ya fyoti yayi ke na kukwikila na munu, ya me lunga ti ba kanga yandi ditadi ya nene na laka, mpe ba losa yandi na mubu. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Kana diboko ya nge ke na kubwisa nge na masumu, zenga yawu. Ya me lutila mbote na nge na kukota na kisika ya luzingu ya tsyelika na diboko mosi. Kana ve, ba ke losa nge na maboko nyonso zole na <char style="w">mbungulu</char>, na kati ya tiya yina ke kufwa ve. [ <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Kuna, bantunga yina ke kudyaka nzutu ke kufwaka ve, mpe tiya ke kufwaka ve<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na babibiliya ya nkaka ya ntama, ba bwelaka bibuku ya 44 tii na 46</char></note>.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Kana dikulu ya nge ke na kubwisa nge na masumu, zenga yawu. Ya me lutila mbote na nge na kukota na kisika ya luzingu ya tsyelika na dikulu mosi. Kana ve, ba ke losa nge na makulu nyonso zole na <char style="w">mbungulu</char>. [ <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Kuna, bantunga yina ke kudyaka nzutu ke kufwaka ve, mpe tiya ke kufwaka ve<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na babibiliya ya nkaka ya ntama, ba bwelaka bibuku ya 44 tii na 46</char></note>.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Kana disu ya nge ke na kubwisa nge na masumu, katula yawu. Ya me lutila mbote na nge na kukota na <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char> na disu mosi. Kana ve, ba ke losa nge na meso nyonso zole na <char style="w">mbungulu</char>. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Kuna, bantunga yina ke kudyaka nzutu ke kufwaka ve, mpe tiya ke kufwaka ve<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Esa 66.24</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />«Ya tsyelika, ba ke bongisa bantu nyonso na tiya, mutindu ba ke bongisaka madya na mungwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Mungwa kele kima ya mbote. Kana mungwa ke dyaka ve na luwu, na yinki beno lenda kuvutula yawu luwu? Beno vwanda mutindu mungwa na kati ya beno, mpe beno zinga na kizunu beno na beno.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Dyambu ya kufwa makwela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lke 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu katukaka kuna, mpe kwendaka na Zude na simu ya nkaka ya nzadi ya Yolodani. Nkonga ya bantu vukanaka dyaka pene-pene ya yandi, mpe mutindu vwandaka kifu ya yandi, yandi vwandaka longisa bawu. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Mwa ndambu ya <char style="w">ba-Falisye</char> kwendaka pene-pene ya Yesu samu na kulebika yandi mutambu. Bawu yufulaka yandi: «Misiku ya beto ke pesaka bakala muswa ya kukatula kento ya yandi na makwela?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu vutulaka: «Wapi <char style="w">Musiku</char> Moyize pesaka beno?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Bawu vutulaka: «Moyize pesaka bakala muswa ya kusonika mukanda ya kufwa makwela mpe kukatula kento na makwela.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Na yina, Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Moyize sonikinaka beno <char style="w">Musiku</char> yina samu ti beno kele na ntima ngolo. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Kasi na mbandukulu ya yinza, ntangu Nzambi yidika bima nyonso, yandi yidikaka bawu kento na bakala. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Ni yawu yina, bakala ke bika tata mpe mama ya yandi, samu na kwenda zinga kintwadi na kento ya yandi, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />mpe bawu zole ke kuma kaka nzutu mosi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Mba 1.27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:24">2.24</ref></char></note>. Na yina, bawu ke dyaka ve bantu zole, kasi kaka muntu mosi. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Na yina, muntu fwana kukabula ve yina Nzambi me vukisa.»<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ntangu bawu kumaka na yinzo, bilandi yufulaka dyaka yandi na dyambu yina. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yandi tubilaka bawu: «Kana bakala katula kento ya yandi na makwela, mpe kwela kento ya nkaka, yandi me sala kinsuza na ntwala ya kento ya ntete. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Mutindu mosi mpe, kana kento manga bakala ya yandi, mpe kwela bakala ya nkaka, yandi me sala kinsuza.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu sakumunaka bana ya fyoti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lke 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Bantu nataka bana ya fyoti na sika ya Yesu samu ti yandi tentika bawu maboko, kasi bilandi sembaka bawu. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ntangu Yesu talaka mutindu yina, yandi dasukaka mpe tubaka na bilandi ya yandi: «Beno bika bana ya fyoti kwiza na sika ya munu! Beno yimina bawu ve samu ti <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char> kele ya bantu yina kele mutindu bawu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kutubila beno: Muntu yina ke ndima ve <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char> mutindu mwana ya fyoti, ke kota kuna ve.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Na manima, Yesu tulaka bawu na nkata, tentikaka bawu maboko, mpe sakumunaka bawu.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakala yina vwandaka mvwama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lke 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Ntangu Yesu vwandaka kwenda, bakala mosi kwizaka na mbangu nyonso, mpe fukamaka na ntwala ya Yesu. Yandi yufulaka Yesu: «Mulongisi ya mbote, yinki mu fwana kusala samu na kuzwa luzingu ya seko?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu vutulaka: «Samu na yinki nge ke na kutuba ti mu kele mbote? Ata muntu kele mbote, kana kaka yandi mosi Nzambi ve. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Nge zaba misiku: “Kufwa muntu ve, kusala kinsuza ve, kulaba ve, kutuba ve kimbangi ya luvunu, kusala ve mambu ya yimbi na muntu, mpe zitisa tata na mama ya nge<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Kbk 20.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Mus 5.16-20</ref></char></note>.” »<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Bakala yina vutulaka: «Mulongisi, mu ke tumamaka na misiku nyonso yina katuka buntwenya ya munu.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu talaka yandi, zolaka yandi mpe tubaka: «Dyambu mosi me bikana na nge: Tekisa bima nyonso yina kele na nge, mpe kabula mbongo na bamputu. Na yina, nge ke kuzwa bimvwama na <char style="w">mazulu</char>. Na manima, kwiza mpe landa munu.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Ntangu yandi kuwaka mutindu yina, yandi kumaka na mawa mpe kwendaka ya kufuluka na kyadi, samu ti yandi vwandaka na bimvwama mingi.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu talaka bilandi ya yandi yina zungaka yandi, mpe tubaka: «Ya kele mpasi mingi na bayina kele na bimvwama na kukota na <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char>!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Bilandi yitukaka mingi ntangu bawu kuwaka mambu yina. Kasi Yesu tubilaka bawu dyaka: «Bana ya munu, ya kele mpasi mingi na kukota na <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char>. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Ya kele mpasi na kibulu yina ba ke bokilaka samo na kukota na dibulu ya ntumbu. Kasi ya me lutila mpasi mingi na mvwama na kukota na <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char>.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Bilandi yitukaka dyaka ya kulutila, mpe vwandaka yufula bawu na bawu: «Na yina, nani lenda kuzwa mpulusu?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu talaka bawu, mpe tubaka: «Na bantu, yawu lenda kusalama ve. Kasi na Nzambi mambu nyonso lenda kusalama samu ti Nzambi ke lembanaka dyambu ve.»<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Na yina, Pyele zabisaka yandi: «Kasi beto, beto me bika bima nyonso samu na kulanda nge.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu vutulaka: «Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kuzabisa beno: Kana muntu bika yinzo ya yandi, bankazi ya yandi, bibusi ya yandi, mama ya yandi, tata ya yandi, bana ya yandi, mpe bilanga ya yandi samu na munu mpe samu na Nsangu ya Mbote, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />ke kuzwa na ntangu yayi: bayinzo, bankazi, bibusi, batata, bamama, bana, bilanga, na bankwamusu mpe, kulutila bambala nkama, mpe luzingu ya mankululu na yinza yina ke kwiza. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Bantu mingi yina kele ntangu yayi bantu ya ntete, ke vwanda bantu ya nsuka, mpe bayina kele bantu ya nsuka, ke vwanda bantu ya ntete.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu zabisaka na mbala ya tatu lufwa mpe mvumbukulu ya yandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lke 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesu vwandaka tambula na mantwala ya bilandi ya yandi ntangu bawu vwandaka kwenda na Yelusalemi. Bilandi vwandaka ya kuyituka samu na mambu nyonso yina bawu kuwaka, mpe bayina vwandaka landa yandi vwandaka na boma. Yesu nataka dyaka bilandi ya yandi kumi na zole na lweka, mpe zabisaka bawu mambu yina ke kumina yandi. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Yandi zabisaka bawu: «Beno kuwa! Beto ke na kukwenda na Yelusalemi kisika ba ke yekula Mwana ya Muntu na maboko ya bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> mpe milongisi ya Misiku. Bawu ke zengila yandi lufwa, mpe ke yekula yandi na sika ya bayina kele ve ba-Zwife. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Bawu ke seka yandi, ke lobola yandi mante, ke bula yandi bikoti, mpe ke kufwa yandi. Kasi yandi ke vumbuka na lufwa na kilumbu ya tatu.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bunene mpe kisalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Zaki mpe Yowane, bana ya Zebede, kwendaka pene-pene ya Yesu, mpe tubaka: «Mulongisi, beto zola ti nge sadila beto mambu yina beto ke lomba nge.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu yufulaka bawu: «Yinki beno zola ti mu sadila beno?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bawu vutulaka: «Pesa beto muswa ya kuvwanda, mosi na lubakala ya nge mpe ya nkaka na lumoso ya nge, ntangu ke vwanda na kati ya Kimfumu ya nge ya nkembo.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Beno zaba ve yinki beno ke na kulomba. Beno lenda kunwa mbungu ya bampasi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:22">Mat 20.22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:39">26.39</ref></char></note> yina mu ke kunwa, to kuzwa mbotokolo yina mu ke kuzwa?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Bawu vutulaka: «Beto ke lenda.» Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Ya tsyelika, beno ke kunwa mbungu yina mu ke kunwa, mpe beno ke kuzwa mbotokolo yina mu ke kuzwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Kasi samu na kuvwanda na lubakala to na lumoso, ni munu ve lenda kutuba yawu. Bisika yina kele ya bayina Nzambi me kubikila yawu.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ntangu bilandi kumi ya nkaka kuwaka mutindu yina, bawu dasukilaka Zaki mpe Yowane. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Na yina, Yesu bokilaka bawu nyonso, mpe tubaka: «Beno zaba ti bantwadisi ya bayinsi ke yalaka bantu ya bawu na ngolo nyonso, mpe bamfumu ke talisaka bantu mpasi mingi. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Kasi ya fwana kuvwanda ve mutindu yina na kati ya beno. Kana mosi na kati ya beno zola kuvwanda mfumu, yandi fwana kuvwanda kisadi ya beno. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Muntu yina zola kuvwanda muntu ya ntete, fwana kuvwanda mundongo ya bantu nyonso. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Ya tsyelika, Mwana ya Muntu me kwiza na yinza samu ti bantu sadila yandi ve, kasi samu ti yandi sadila bantu, mpe pesa luzingu ya yandi mutindu munkayulu samu na kukuula bantu mingi.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu belusaka mpofo ya nkumbu Batime</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lke 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yesu na bilandi ya yandi kumaka na mbanza Yeliko. Ntangu yandi vwandaka basika na mbanza yina na bilandi ya yandi mpe na nkonga ya nene ya bantu, mpofo mosi na nkumbu Baatime, mwana ya Time, vwandaka ya kuvwanda na lweka ya nzila mpe vwandaka lomba bantu mbongo. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ntangu yandi kuwaka ti Yesu ya Nazaleti ke na kuluta, yandi lookaka: «Yesu, Mwana ya Davidi, tala munu kyadi!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bantu mingi vwandaka semba yandi samu ti yandi vwanda swi. Kasi yandi lutilaka dyaka na kulooka ngolo: «Mwana ya Davidi, tala munu kyadi!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu kangamaka mpe tubaka: «Beno bokila yandi.» Bawu bokilaka mpofo mpe zabisaka yandi: «Vwanda na kibakala mpe telama. Yandi ke na kubokila nge.»<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Na yina, yandi losaka kiyunga ya yandi. Yandi dumukaka mpe kwendaka kisika vwandaka Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu yufulaka yandi: «Yinki nge zola ti mu sala samu na nge?» Mpofo vutulaka: «Mulongisi, sala ti mu tala dyaka.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu zabisaka: «Kwenda, kiminu ya nge me belusa nge.» Kaka na ntangu yina, mpofo bandaka dyaka na kutala, mpe landaka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">NKOTOLO ya Yesu na mbanza Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lke 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yne 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Ntangu bawu vwandaka ntama mingi ve na Yelusalemi, mpe kumaka na bizunga ya babwala Betefaze na Betani, pene-pene na mongo ya bayinti ya olive. Yesu fidisaka bilandi zole ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Yandi zabisaka bawu: «Beno kwenda na bwala yina kele na mantwala ya beno. Ntangu beno ke kuma, beno ke tala mbuluku ya fyoti ya kukanga na yinti, mpe yina ata muntu me yuluka ntete ve. Beno nyangula yawu, mpe beno nata yawu awa. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Kana muntu yufula beno: “Samu na yinki beno ke na kusala mutindu yina?” Beno zabisa yandi: “<char style="w">Mfumu</char> ke na yawu nsatu, kasi yandi ke vutula yawu malu-malu yayi.” »<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Na yina, bawu kwendaka mpe talaka na ngaanda, mbuluku ya fyoti na bala-bala, ya kukanga pene-pene ya mwelo. Bawu nyangulaka yawu. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Bantu ya nkaka yina vwandaka kuna yufulaka bawu: «Yinki beno ke na kusala? Samu na yinki beno ke na kunyangula mbuluku ya fyoti yina?»<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Bilandi tubaka mutindu Yesu zabisaka bawu, mpe ba pesaka bawu muswa ya kunata yawu. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Bawu nataka yawu na sika ya Yesu. Bawu tulaka binkuti ya bawu na zulu ya mbuluku, mpe Yesu vwandaka na zulu ya yawu. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Bantu mingi tandaka binkuti ya bawu na nzila. Ba ya nkaka tandaka makasa yina bawu vwandaka zenga na bilanga. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Bayina vwandaka tambula na mantwala mpe na manima ya Yesu vwandaka looka: «Ozana! Nkembo na Nzambi! Bika ti <char style="w">Mfumu</char> Nzambi kusakumuna muntu yina ke na kukwiza na Nkumbu ya yandi! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Bika ti Nzambi kusakumuna Kimfumu yina ke na kukwiza, Kimfumu ya nkooko ya beto Davidi! Ozana! Nkembo na Nzambi na <char style="w">mazulu</char>!»<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu kumaka na Yelusalemi, mpe kotaka na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>. Na manima ya kutala bisika nyonso na balweka ya yandi, yandi kwendaka na mbanza Betani na bilandi kumi na zole samu ti bwisi vwandaka me yila.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu singaka yinti ya <char style="w">fike</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Na kilumbu yina landaka, ntangu bawu vwandaka basika na bwala Betani, Yesu kumaka na nsatu. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Yesu vwandaka ntete ntama, mpe talaka yinti ya <char style="w">fike</char> yina vwandaka na makasa, mpe kwendaka pene-pene ya yawu samu na kutala kana yawu vwandaka na bambuma. Kasi ntangu yandi kumaka kuna, yandi talaka kaka makasa samu ti ya vwandaka ve ntangu yina bayinti ya <char style="w">fike</char> ke butaka bambuma. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Na yina, Yesu tubaka na yinti ya <char style="w">fike</char>: «Ata muntu ke kudya dyaka bambuma ya nge.» Bilandi kuwaka mambu yina Yesu tubaka.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na kati ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lke 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yne 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Na manima, bawu kumaka na Yelusalemi. Yesu kotaka na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, mpe bingisaka bayina vwandaka tekisa mpe sumba bima kuna. Yandi bwisaka bamesa ya bisobisi-mbongo, mpe bakiti ya bayina vwandaka tekisa mabembe. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Yandi vwandaka yimina bantu yina vwandaka nata bima na kulutila na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Na manima, yandi longisaka bawu mambu yayi: «Dibuku ya Nzambi ke tubaka: “Yinzo ya munu ke vwanda yinzo ya lusambulu samu na bantu ya bayinsi nyonso<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Esa 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yel 7.11</ref></char></note>.”» Kasi beno me kitula yawu kisika yina miyibi ke bumbamaka!<figure style="fig" alt="Les vendeurs dans le Temple" file="lb00316b.tif" size="col" loc="Marc 11.15-16" copy="Louise Bass" ref="11.17">Bantu ya mumbungu na Yinzo ya Nzambi</figure> <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> mpe milongisi ya Misiku kuwaka yawu, mpe vwandaka sosa wapi mutindu bawu lenda kufwa Yesu. Ya tsyelika, bawu vwandaka na boma ya yandi samu ti nkonga nyonso vwandaka yituka na ndongosolo ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ntangu nkokila kumaka, Yesu na bilandi ya yandi basikaka na mbanza.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndongosolo ya yinti ya <char style="w">fike</char> yina yumaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Na suka, ntangu bawu vwandaka luta, bawu talaka ti yinti yango ya <char style="w">bafike</char> yumaka tii na myanzi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Pyele bambukaka moyo mpe tubaka: «Mulongisi! Tala yinti yina nge singaka me yuma.» <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Na yina, Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Beno vwanda na kiminu na Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kutubila beno, kana muntu tuba na mongo yayi: “Katuka awa, mpe kwenda kubwa na mubu”, mpe kana yandi sala ve ntembe na kati ya ntima ya yandi, kasi yandi kwikila ti mambu yina yandi ke na kuzonza ke salama, yawu ke salama. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ni yawu yina, mu ke na kuzabisa beno: Bima nyonso yina beno ke lomba na lusambulu, beno fwana kukwikila ti beno me kuzwa yawu, mpe Nzambi ke pesa beno yawu. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Ntangu beno kele ya kutelama samu na kusambila, kana beno kele na dyambu na muntu, beno lemvokila yandi samu ti Tata ya beno yina kele na <char style="w">mazulu</char> lemvokila beno mpe yimbi yina beno me sala. [ <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Kana beno lemvokila ve bampangi ya beno, Tata ya beno yina kele na <char style="w">mazulu</char> ke lemvokila ve beno mpe yimbi yina beno me sala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na babibiliya ya nkaka ya ntama, kitini yayi, ba bwelaka yawu na kubwela</char></note>.]»<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wapi sika ke katukaka bumfumu ya Yesu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lke 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesu na bilandi ya yandi vutukaka na Yelusalemi. Ntangu Yesu vwandaka tambula na kati ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> mpe milongisi ya Misiku kintwadi na <char style="w">bakuluntu</char> ya ba-Zwife kwizaka pene-pene ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Bawu yufulaka yandi: «Na lutumu ya nani nge ke salaka mambu yayi? Nani ke pesaka nge bumfumu ya kusala yawu?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu vutulaka: «Mu ke yufula beno kyuvu kaka mosi. Kana beno pesa munu mvutu, munu mpe mu ke zabisa beno na lutumu ya nani mu ke salaka mambu yayi. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Nani fidisaka Yowane na kubotika bantu? Nzambi to bantu? Beno pesa munu mvutu?» <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Kasi bawu bandaka na kusolola bawu na bawu mutindu yayi: «Kana beto tuba ti ni Nzambi fidisaka Yowane, yandi ke yufula beto: “Samu na yinki beno kwikilaka yandi ve?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Kana beto tuba mpe ti bantu fidisaka yandi.» (Bawu vwandaka na boma ya nkonga, samu ti bantu nyonso vwandaka banza ti Yowane vwandaka <char style="w">mumbikudi</char> ya tsyelika.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Na yina, bawu vutulaka: «Beto zaba ve.» Yesu vutulaka: «Munu mpe, mu ke zabisa beno ve na lutumu ya nani mu ke salaka mambu yayi.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kingana ya bisadi-bilanga ya vinu ya ntima ya yimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lke 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Na manima, Yesu bandaka na kuzonzila bawu na bingana: «Bakala mosi kunaka bilanga ya bayinti ya vinu, mpe zungaka yawu na kikaku. Yandi timunaka dibulu samu na kukamuna bambuma ya vinu, mpe tungaka yinzo ya yinda ya kibandu samu na mikengi. Na manima, yandi bikaka yawu na maboko ya bisadi-bilanga ya vinu, mpe kwendaka na nzyetolo. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Na ntangu ya kubuka bambuma ya vinu, yandi fidisaka kisadi mosi na sika ya bisadi-bilanga ya vinu samu na kuzwa kikunku ya yandi ya bambuma ya vinu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Kasi bisadi-bilanga ya vinu bwilaka kisadi yina. Bawu bulaka yandi, mpe vutulaka yandi maboko mpamba. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" /><char style="w">Mfumu</char> ya bilanga fidisaka dyaka kisadi ya nkaka. Bawu bulaka kisadi yango na yintu, mpe fingaka yandi. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Yandi fidisaka dyaka kisadi ya nkaka, mpe bawu kufwaka kisadi yango. Bawu salaka mpe mutindu mosi na bisadi nyonso ya nkaka yina mfumu ya bilanga fidisaka. Bawu bulaka ba ya nkaka, mpe kufwaka ba ya nkaka. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" /><char style="w">Mfumu</char> ya bilanga bikanaka kaka na mwana mosi ya yandi yina yandi vwandaka zola mingi. Yandi fidisaka yandi na nsukunu, samu ti yandi vwandaka banza ti bawu ke zitisa mwana ya yandi.» <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Kasi bisadi-bilanga ya vinu tubaka bawu na bawu: «“Ni yandi ke kuzwa difwa ya bilanga yayi ya vinu. Beto kufwa yandi samu ti bilanga yayi vwanda ya beto.”» <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Na yina, bawu bwilaka yandi. Bawu kufwaka yandi mpe losaka nzutu ya yandi ntama na bilanga ya vinu.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yinki mfumu ya bilanga ke sala? Yandi ke kwiza, ke kufwa bawu, mpe ke pesa bilanga ya vinu na bisadi-bilanga ya nkaka. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Beno me tangaka ntete ve mambu yina ke tubaka Dibuku ya Nzambi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">«“Ditadi yina bitungi-bayinzo losaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">me kuma ditadi ya kulutila mfunu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">yina ke na kusimba yinzo nyonso.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Ni <char style="w">Mfumu</char> salaka ti yawu vwanda mutindu yina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">mpe ya kele mambu ya ngitukulu samu na beto<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Mga 118.22-23</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Bamfumu ya ba-Zwife sosaka mayela ya kukanga Yesu, samu ti bawu zabaka ti ni na bawu Yesu tubaka kingana yina. Kasi bawu vwandaka na boma ya nkonga yina vwandaka kuna. Na yina, bawu bikaka yandi mpe kwendaka.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpaku ya kufuta na ntinu <char style="w">Sezale</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lke 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Bamfumu ya ba-Zwife fidisaka mwa <char style="w">ba-Falisye</char> mpe mwa bantu ya kimvuka ya Elode na sika ya Yesu samu na kubwisa Yesu na mutambu na kupesa yandi kyuvu. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Bawu kwizaka zabisa Yesu: «Mulongisi, beto zaba ti nge ke tubaka butsyelika, mpe nge kele ve na boma ya muntu samu ti nge ke swasikisaka bantu ve. Nge ke longisaka na butsyelika nyonso mambu yina Nzambi ke zolaka ti beto sala. Na yina, beto kele na muswa ya kufuta mpaku na ntinu <char style="w">Sezale</char> to ya kufuta yawu ve? Beto fwana kufuta yawu to ve?»<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Kasi Yesu zabaka ti bawu vwandaka bantu ya bantima zole. Na yina, yandi zabisaka bawu: «Samu na yinki beno ke na kumeka munu? Beno natina munu Denalya mosi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:28">Mat 18.28</ref></char></note> samu ti mu tala yawu.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Bawu natinaka yandi yawu, mpe yandi yufulaka bawu: «Kizizi mpe nkumbu yina kele ya kusonama awa kele ya nani?» Bawu vutulaka: «Yawu kele ya ntinu <char style="w">Sezale</char>.» <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Na yina Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Beno pesa na ntinu <char style="w">Sezale</char> bima yina kele ya Sezale, mpe na Nzambi bima yina kele ya Nzambi.» Bawu yituka mingi na mvutu yina Yesu vutulaka bawu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyuvu na yina me tadila mvumbukulu ya bantu ya kufwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lke 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />
    <char style="w">Ba-Saduse</char> kwizaka na sika ya Yesu. (Ba-Saduse kele bantu yina ke tubaka ti bantu ya kufwa ke vumbuka ve.) Bawu yufulaka Yesu mutindu yayi: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Mulongisi! Moyize pesaka beto <char style="w">Musiku</char> yayi: “Kana bakala ya kukwela kufwa ata kubuta bana na kento ya yandi, leki to yaya ya yandi fwana kukwela mufwidi yina samu na kubutila yandi bana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Mus 25.5-6</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Kasi ya vwandaka na bampangi nsambwadi. Mpangi ya ntete kwelaka kento, mpe kufwaka ata kubuta bana na kento yina. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Mpangi ya zole kwelaka mufwidi, mpe kufwaka ata kubuta mwana na yandi, mutindu mosi mpe mpangi ya tatu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Bampangi nyonso nsambwadi yina kwelaka kento yango, mpe kufwaka ata kubuta mwana na yandi. Na manima ya bawu nyonso, kento mpe kufwaka. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Na yina, ntangu bantu ya kufwa ke vumbuka na lufwa, yandi ke vwanda kento ya nani na bawu nyonso nsambwadi, samu ti bawu nyonso kwelaka yandi?» <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu vutulaka: «Beno ke na kuvunama samu ti beno zaba ve Dibuku ya Nzambi to lulendo ya Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ya tsyelika, ntangu bantu ya kufwa ke vumbuka, bakento na babakala ke kwelana ve. Kasi bawu ke vwanda mutindu <char style="w">bambazi</char> na <char style="w">mazulu</char>. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Na yina me tadila dyambu ya mvumbukulu ya bantu ya kufwa, beno me tangaka ntete ve na dibuku ya Moyize, kibuku ya mambu ya Nzambi yina ke zonzilaka divunda ya tiya? Beto ke tangaka ti Nzambi tubaka na Moyize: “Mu kele Nzambi ya Abalayami, ya Isaaki, mpe ya Yakobi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:2">Kbk 3.2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:6">6</ref></char></note>.” » <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Yesu tubaka dyaka: «Nzambi kele ve Nzambi ya bantu ya kufwa, kasi ya bantu ya moyo. Na yina, beno ke na kuvunama mingi.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lutumu yina me lutila mfunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lke 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Mulongisi mosi ya Misiku kuwaka bawu ntangu bawu vwandaka solola. Yandi talaka ti Yesu zonzaka mbote. Na yina, yandi kwendaka pene-pene ya Yesu, mpe yufulaka Yesu: «Wapi <char style="w">Musiku</char> me lutila mfunu na misiku nyonso?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu vutulaka: «Musiku yina me lutila mfunu ke tubaka mutindu yayi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:29">«“Kuwa Isayeli! <char style="w">Mfumu</char> Nzambi ya beto kele kaka yandi mosi <char style="w">Mfumu</char>.<verse eid="MRK 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Nge fwana kuzola <char style="w">Mfumu</char> Nzambi ya nge na ntima ya nge nyonso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:30">na mwela ya nge nyonso, na mayela ya nge nyonso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:30">mpe na ngolo nyonso ya nge<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4-5">Mus 6.4-5</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Musiku ya zole ke tubaka mutindu yayi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:31">«“Nge fwana kuzola mpangi ya nge mutindu nge mosi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Knz 19.18</ref></char></note>.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 12:31">Ya kele dyaka ve na <char style="w">Musiku</char> ya nkaka yina me lutila misiku zole yayi mfunu.»<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Na yina, <char style="w">mulongisi ya Misiku</char> tubaka: «Ya tsyelika, Mulongisi! Mambu yina nge me zonza kele ya tsyelika: Kaka ni yandi mosi kele Nzambi, mpe Nzambi ya nkaka kele ve. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Konso muntu fwana kuzola yandi na ntima nyonso, na mayela nyonso, mpe na ngolo nyonso ya yandi. Yandi fwana kuzola mpe mpangi ya yandi mutindu yandi mosi. Misiku yayi me lutila mbote na makabu nyonso mpe minkayulu yina ba ke yokaka samu na Nzambi.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu talaka ti mulongisi yayi ya Misiku zonzaka na ndwenga nyonso. Na yina, Yesu tubaka: «Nge kele ve ntama na kukota na <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char>.» Na manima, ata muntu kuzwaka dyaka ngolo ya kuyufula yandi kyuvu.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="w">Masiya</char> mpe Davidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lke 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yesu vwandaka longisa na kati ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, mpe yufulaka: «Wapi mutindu milongisi ya Misiku lenda kutuba ti <char style="w">Masiya</char> kele Mwana ya Davidi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Ya tsyelika, yandi mosi Davidi yina vwandaka ya kufuluka na Mpeve ya Longo tubaka:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">«“<char style="w">Mfumu</char> Nzambi me tuba na <char style="w">Mfumu</char> ya munu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Vwanda na lubakala ya munu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">tii ntangu mu ke tula bambeni ya nge na yisi ya makulu ya nge<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mga 110.1</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />«Kana yandi mosi Davidi ke na kubokila yandi “<char style="w">Mfumu</char>”, wapi mutindu <char style="w">Masiya</char> lenda kuvwanda dyaka mwana ya Davidi?» Nkonga ya nene vwandaka kuwa Yesu na kilengi nyonso.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bankebosolo samu na milongisi ya Misiku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Lke 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Na ndongosolo ya yandi, yandi vwandaka tuba: «Beno sala keba na milongisi ya Misiku. Bawu ke zolaka na kutambula na binkuti ya yinda, mpe ti bantu pesa bawu bambote ya buzitu na bisika ya mfunu ya mbanza. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Bawu ke zolaka na kuvwanda na bakiti ya ntete na <char style="w">bayinzo ya lusambulu ya ba-Zwife</char>, mpe na bakiti ya buzitu na <char style="w">mikembo</char> ya nene. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Bawu ke bakaka bimvwama nyonso ya mifwidi ya bakento, mpe ke salaka lusambulu ya yinda samu ti bantu tala bawu. Nzambi ke pesa bawu kitumbu ya ngolo!»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Munkayulu ya mufwidi ya mputu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Lke 21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Na manima, Yesu kwendaka vwanda pene-pene ya sanduku ya minkayulu ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, mpe talaka wapi mutindu bantu vwandaka tula mbongo na kati. Bamvwama mingi vwandaka tula mbongo mingi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Mufwidi ya mputu ya kento kwizaka mpe tulaka bapata zole ya mfunu mingi ve. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Na yina, Yesu bokilaka bilandi ya yandi, mpe zabisaka bawu: «Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kutubila beno, mufwidi ya mputu yayi me lutila kupesa munkayulu kulutila bantu nyonso yina me tula minkayulu na kati ya sanduku yayi. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Ya tsyelika, bantu nyonso yayi me tula mbongo yina vwandaka na bawu nsatu ve. Kasi yandi na buwelo ya yandi, yandi me tula nyonso yina vwandaka na yandi nsatu samu na kuzinga.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu zabisaka ti <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> ke mwangana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Lke 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Ntangu Yesu vwandaka basika na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, mosi na kati ya bilandi ya yandi tubaka: «Mulongisi! Tala matadi ya nene yayi! Tala bunene ya yinzo yayi!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu vutulaka: «Nge me tala yinzo ya yayi? Ata ditadi mosi ke bikana na zulu ya ditadi ya nkaka. Nyonso ke mwangana.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbandukulu ya bampasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lke 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu vwandaka ya kuvwanda na mongo ya bayinti ya olive yina vwandaka talasanaka na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>. Pyele, Zaki, Yowane, mpe Andele yufulaka yandi na lweka: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Zabisa beto wapi ntangu mambu yina ke salama, mpe wapi kidimbu ke lakisa ti ntangu me fwana samu ti mambu yina salama?» <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Na yina, Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Beno sala keba samu ti muntu vuna beno ve. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Bantu mingi ke kwiza na Nkumbu ya munu. Bawu ke tuba: “Mu kele <char style="w">Masiya</char>”, mpe bawu ke vuna bantu mingi. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ntangu beno ke kuwa bamvita ke na kusalama, mpe bansangu ya bamvita yina ke kwiza, beno vwanda ve na boma. Mambu nyonso yina fwana kusalama, kasi yawu ke vwanda ntete ve nsuka ya yinza. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Bantu ya yinsi mosi ke nwanisa bantu ya yinsi ya nkaka, mpe yinsi mosi ya kintinu ke nwanisa yinsi ya kintinu ya nkaka. Na bizunga mingi, nsatu ke kota, mpe ntoto ke ningana na ngolo nyonso. Mambu nyonso yayi ke vwanda mutindu mbandukulu ya bampasi yina kento ke talaka na ntangu ya kubuta.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />«Kasi beno sala keba samu na beno mosi. Bantu ke nata beno na bayinzo ya lufundusu. Bawu ke bula beno bikoti na kati ya <char style="w">bayinzo ya lusambulu ya ba-Zwife</char>. Bawu ke fundisa beno na ntwala ya bantwadisi mpe bantinu samu na munu, mpe beno ke vwanda bambangi ya munu na ntwala ya bawu. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ntete-ntete, bantu fwana kuzabisa Nsangu ya Mbote na yinza nyonso. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ntangu ba ke nata beno samu na kuyekula beno, beno vwanda na boma ve na kusosa mambu yina beno ke zonza. Kasi beno zonza mabanza yina ke kumina beno na ntangu yina, samu ti yawu ke katuka ve na mayela ya beno, kasi na Mpeve ya Longo. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Bantu ke yekula bampangi ya bawu mosi samu na kuzengila bawu lufwa. Batata ke sala mpe mutindu mosi samu na bana ya bawu. Bana ke kuma bambeni ya bibuti ya bawu, mpe ke kufwa bawu. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Bantu nyonso ke yina beno samu na munu. Kasi muntu yina ke tatamana tii na nsukunu ke kuzwa mpulusu.»<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimwangisi ya Nene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24.15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Lke 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />«Ntangu beno ke tala muntu yina ba ke bokilaka Kisafudi-Kimwangisi ya kuvwanda na kisika yina yandi fwana kuvwanda ve, (Muntu yina ke na kutanga mambu yayi, fwana kubakula yawu mbote!) Na yina, bantu yina ke vwanda na Zude, fwana kukima na zulu ya myongo. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Muntu yina ke vwanda na kibandu ya yinzo, fwana kukulumuka ve, mpe kota ve na yinzo samu na kubaka kima na kati. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Muntu yina ke vwanda na bilanga, fwana kuvutuka ve na yinzo samu na kubaka kiyunga ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Na bilumbu yina, kyadi na bakento yina ke vwanda na bivumu, mpe na bayina ke nwikisa bana mabene! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Beno sambila Nzambi samu ti mambu yayi salama ve na ntangu ya bamvula mpe ya madidi ya ngolo. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Ya tsyelika, bilumbu yina ke vwanda bilumbu ya bampasi ya kulutila. Katuka mbandukulu ya yinza yina Nzambi yidikaka tii ntangu yayi, bampasi ya mutindu yina me salamaka ntete ve, mpe yawu ke salama dyaka ve. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Kana <char style="w">Mfumu</char> bakaka ve lukanu ya kukulula lutangu ya bilumbu yina ya mpasi, ata muntu lendaka zinga dyaka. Kasi Nzambi kululaka yawu samu na bantu yina yandi soolaka. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Na yina, kana muntu zabisa beno: “Beno tala! <char style="w">Masiya</char> kele awa” to “Beno tala! Yandi kele kuna”, beno kwikila yandi ve, <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />samu ti ba-masiya ya luvunu mpe mimbikudi ya luvunu ke talana. Bawu ke sala bidimbu ya ngitukulu mpe bimangu ya nene samu na kuvuna bantu, mpe kana bawu lenda, bawu ke vuna mpe bayina Nzambi soolaka. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Na yina, beno sala keba! Mu me zabisa beno mambu nyonso ntete yawu salama.»<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwizulu ya Mwana ya Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Lke 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />«Kasi na bilumbu yina, na manima ya bampasi yina, ntangu ke lezima dyaka ve, mpe ngonda ke pesa dyaka ve nsemo. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Bambwetete ke kubwa, mpe bima ya <char style="w">mazulu</char> yina kele na lulendo ke ningana. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Na yina, bantu ke tala Mwana ya Muntu yina ke kwiza na kati ya matuti na lulendo mpe nkembo mingi. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Yandi ke fidisa <char style="w">bambazi</char> ya yandi na bandambu nyonso na yinza ya muvimba samu na kukutikisa kisika mosi bantu nyonso yina Nzambi soolaka.»<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubakula ndongosolo ya yinti ya <char style="w">fike</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Lke 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />«Beno bakula ndongosolo yina ke lakisaka beno yinti ya <char style="w">fike</char>: Ntangu bintala ya yawu ke kumaka pete-pete, mpe makasa ya malu-malu ke basikaka, beno ke zabaka ti ntangu ya bamvula me kuma pene-pene. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Mutindu mosi, ntangu beno mpe ke tala ti mambu yina ke na kusalama, beno fwana kuzaba ti nkwizulu ya Mwana ya Muntu me kuma pene-pene. Yandi kele na myelo ya bayinzo ya beno. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kuzabisa beno: Bantu nyonso yina ke na kuzinga ntangu yayi ke kufwa ve ntete mambu nyonso yayi kusalama. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Zulu na ntoto ke zimbana, kasi mambu ya munu ke zimbana ve.»<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaka Nzambi zaba kilumbu yina ke kwiza Mwana ya Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24.36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />«Ata muntu zaba kilumbu mpe ngunga yina mambu yayi ke salama. Ata <char style="w">bambazi</char> ya <char style="w">mazulu</char> mpe ata <char style="w">Mwana ya Nzambi</char> zaba yawu. Kaka ni Tata yandi mosi zaba yawu. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Beno sala keba! Beno lala ve pongi samu ti beno zaba ve wapi ntangu yawu ke salama. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Yawu ke vwanda mutindu muntu yina ke na kukwenda na nzyetolo. Yandi ke bika yinzo ya yandi na maboko ya bisadi ya yandi. Yandi ke pesa kisalu na konso kisadi, mpe ke tuba na mikengi ya mwelo ya lupangu na kulala ve pongi. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Na yina, beno lala ve pongi samu ti beno zaba ve wapi ntangu mfumu ya yinzo ke vutuka. Yandi lenda kuvutuka na nkokila, to na kati-kati ya mpimpa, to ntangu nsusu ya ntete ke kubaka, to na suka. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Kana na mpamukunu yandi vutuka, yandi fwana kukuta ve beno ya kulala pongi. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Mambu yina mu ke na kutubila beno, mu ke na kutuba yawu na bantu nyonso: Beno lala ve pongi.»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Bamfumu ya ba-Zwife salaka mfundu ya kufwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lke 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yne 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Bilumbu zole bikanaka na kukuma na mukembo ya Paki mpe ya mampa yina ba ke funisaka ve. Bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> mpe milongisi ya Misiku vwandaka sosa wapi mutindu ya kukanga Yesu na mansweki samu na kufwa yandi. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ya tsyelika, bawu vwandaka tuba: «Beto fwana kukanga yandi ve na <char style="w">mukembo ya Paki</char> samu ti bantu sala muvusu ve.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kento mosi tulaka mananasi na yintu ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yne 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu vwandaka na Betani na kati ya yinzo ya Simoni, muntu ya bwazi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Simoni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">beelaka kimbevo ya bwazi, mpe belukaka. Kasi bantu vwandaka bika ve na kubokila yandi «Simoni muntu ya bwazi».</char></note>. Ntangu yandi vwandaka na mesa, kento mosi kotaka kuna na kitutu ya alabati<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Alabati </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kele ditadi ya mpembe yina ba-Zwife vwandaka yidikila bitutu.</char></note> ya kufuluka na mananasi ya ntalu mingi yina ba yidikaka na nale<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nale </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kele mananasi yina ba vwandaka yidika na kifulu yina ke menaka na yinsi ya Indya.</char></note>. Yandi zengaka yintu ya kitutu, mpe sekulaka mananasi na yintu ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bantu ya nkaka yina vwandaka kuna vwandaka ve na kilengi mpe tubaka bawu na bawu: «Samu na yinki yandi me bebisa mananasi yayi? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Ba lendaka tekisa yawu na ntalu ya kulutila Badenalya bankama tatu (300)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:28">Mat 18.28</ref></char></note>, mpe kukabula mbongo yina na bamputu!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:5">Na yina, bawu dasukilaka kento yina. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Kasi Yesu tubaka: «Beno bika yandi! Samu na yinki beno ke na kukwamisa yandi? Mambu yina yandi me sala samu na munu kele mbote. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Ya tsyelika, bamputu ke vwanda na beno ntangu nyonso, mpe konso ntangu yina beno zola, beno lenda kusala bawu mambu ya mbote. Kasi munu, mu ke vwanda ve na beno ntangu nyonso. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Yandi me sala mambu yina yandi me lenda na kusala. Yandi me tula mananasi na nzutu ya munu samu na kukubika nzikulu ya munu. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kuzabisa beno: Bisika nyonso yina ba ke zabisa Nsangu ya Mbote yayi na yinza, ba ke zonzila mambu yina kento yayi me sala, mpe ba ke bambukila yandi moyo.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda bakaka lukanu ya kuyekula Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lke 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Na yina, Yuda Isekayote, mosi na kati ya bilandi kumi na zole, kwendaka tala bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> samu na kuyekula bawu Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ntangu bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> kuwaka mutindu yina, bawu kumaka na kilengi mingi mpe pesaka yandi nsilulu ya kupesa yandi mbongo. Na yina, Yuda vwandaka sosa ntangu ya mbote samu na kuyekula bawu Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kudyaka madya ya Paki na bilandi ya yandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Lke 22.7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yne 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Kilumbu ya ntete ya <char style="w">mukembo ya Paki</char> yina bantu vwandaka kufwa mameme ya fyoti samu na kudya, mpe yina bantu vwandaka kudya mampa yina ba ke funisaka ve, bilandi ya Yesu yufulaka yandi: «Wapi sika nge zola ti beto kwenda kuyidikila nge madya ya <char style="w">Paki</char>?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Na yina, Yesu fidisaka zole na kati ya bilandi ya yandi, mpe zabisaka bawu: «Beno kwenda na mbanza, mpe beno ke bwabana bakala mosi yina ke na kunata diyuki ya maza. Beno landa yandi, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />mpe kisika yina yandi ke kota, beno tuba na mfumu ya yinzo ti Mulongisi ke na kuyufula nge: “Wapi sika kele kivinga yina mu ke kudya <char style="w">Paki</char> na bilandi ya munu?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Yandi ke lakisa beno na kibandu ya yinzo, kivinga ya nene yina kele ya kukubama, mpe yawu kele na bima nyonso yina me fwanana. Ni kuna beno ke yidika bima nyonso samu na madya ya <char style="w">Paki</char>.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Bilandi kwendaka mpe kumaka na mbanza. Bawu talaka mambu nyonso mutindu Yesu zabisaka bawu, mpe bawu yidikaka bima nyonso samu na madya ya <char style="w">Paki</char>.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Ntangu mpimpa kumaka, Yesu kwendaka kuna na bilandi ya yandi kumi na zole. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Ntangu bawu vwandaka kudya na mesa, Yesu tubaka: «Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kuzabisa beno, mosi na kati ya beno yina ke na kudya kintwadi na munu ke yekula munu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Bilandi kumaka na kyadi ya kulutila, mpe bandaka na kuyufula yandi mosi na mosi: «Ya kele munu?»<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu vutulaka: «Ya kele mosi na kati ya beno kumi na zole. Muntu yina ke na kutula diboko ya yandi kintwadi na munu na kati ya ndonga. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Ya tsyelika, Mwana ya Muntu ke kufwa mutindu Dibuku ya Nzambi ke zabisaka yawu. Kasi kyadi na muntu yina ke yekula yandi! Ya vwandaka mbote na muntu yina na kubutuka ve.»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Madya ya <char style="w">Mfumu</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Lke 22.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ntangu bawu vwandaka kudya, Yesu bakaka dimpa. Na manima ya kutonda Nzambi, yandi bukunaka yawu mpe pesaka yawu na bilandi ya yandi na kutuba: «Beno baka, yayi ni nzutu ya munu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Na manima, yandi bakaka mbungu ya vinu. Yandi tondaka Nzambi, pesaka yawu na bilandi ya yandi, mpe bawu nyonso kunwaka yawu. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yandi zabisaka bawu: «Yayi ni menga ya munu, menga ya ngwisani yina me mwangana samu na bantu mingi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kuzabisa beno: Katuka ntangu yayi, mu ke kunwa dyaka ve vinu yayi tii kilumbu yina mu ke kunwa vinu ya malu-malu na kati ya <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char>.» <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Na manima, bawu kembisaka Nzambi na banzimbu, mpe kwendaka na mongo ya bayinti ya olive.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu zabisaka ti Pyele ke manga yandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lke 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yne 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu tubaka na bilandi ya yandi: «Beno nyonso ke bika munu samu ti Dibuku ya Nzambi ke tubaka: “Mu ke kufwa muvungi ya mameme, mpe mameme nyonso ke mwangana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zli 13.7</ref></char></note>”.» <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Yesu tubaka dyaka: «Kasi ntangu mu ke vumbuka na lufwa, mu ke kwenda kuvingila beno na Ngalili.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Pyele zabisaka yandi: «Ata ti bawu nyonso bika nge, munu, mu ke bika nge ve!» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu vutulaka: «Ya tsyelika, mu ke na kuzabisa nge, kaka na mpimpa ya bubu yayi, ntete nsusu kuba bambala zole, nge ke manga munu bambala tatu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Kasi Pyele tubaka dyaka na ngolo nyonso: «Ata ti mu fwana kufwa kintwadi na nge, mu ke manga nge ve.» Bawu nyonso mpe tubaka mutindu yina.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu sambilaka na Ngetesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lke 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Ntangu Yesu na bilandi ya yandi kumaka na kisika yina ba ke bokilaka Ngetesemane, Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Beno vwanda awa ntangu mu ke sambila.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Yandi nataka Pyele, Zaki, mpe Yowane. Yandi bandaka na kutala mpasi na ntima mpe na kukuma na boma. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Na yina, yandi zabisaka bawu: «Ntima ya munu kele ya kufuluka na kyadi samu na lufwa. Beno vwanda awa, mpe beno kyelola meso.» <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Yandi kwendaka na mwa mantwala. Yandi kubwaka na ntoto mpe sambilaka samu na kulomba na Nzambi kana yawu lenda kusalama ti ngunga yina ya mpasi katuka pene-pene ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Yandi vwandaka tuba: «Abba! Tata ya munu, kana yawu lenda kusalama, katula mbungu yayi ya mpasi pene-pene na munu. Kasi kusala ve luzolo ya munu. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:22">Mat 20.22</ref></char></note>Sala kaka luzolo ya nge.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Na manima, yandi vutukaka kisika vwandaka bilandi tatu yina, mpe kutaka bawu ya kulala. Na yina, yandi tubaka na Pyele: «Simoni, nge me lala! Nge me lenda ve na kukyelola meso ata na ngunga mosi. <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Beno kyelola meso, mpe beno sambila samu ti beno kubwa ve na ntontolo. Ntima ya muntu kele ya kufuluka na nsatu ya kusala mambu ya mbote, kasi nzutu kele ya kulemba.»<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Yesu bikaka dyaka bawu, mpe sambilaka dyaka na kuzonza mambu yina yandi zonzaka ntete. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Yandi vutukaka dyaka kisika vwandaka bilandi tatu yina, mpe kutaka dyaka bawu ya kulala samu ti meso ya bawu vwandaka ya kufuluka na pongi. Bawu vwandaka zaba ve yinki ya kuzabisa yandi. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ntangu yandi vutukaka na mbala ya tatu kisika vwandaka bilandi ya yandi, yandi zabisaka bawu: «Beno ke na kutatamana na kulala, mpe beno ke na kupema! Ntangu yayi, ngunga me lunga yina ba ke yekula Mwana ya Muntu na maboko ya misumuki. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Beno telama, mpe beto kwenda! Muntu yina ke na kuyekula munu me kwiza.»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Binwani kangaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lke 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yne 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Kaka na ntangu yina, ntete yandi manisa na kuzonza, Yuda, mosi na kati ya bilandi kumi na zole, kumaka kuna. Yandi kwizaka na nkonga ya nene ya bantu yina vwandaka na bambele mpe bayinti na maboko. Ni bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>, milongisi ya Misiku, mpe <char style="w">bakuluntu</char> ya ba-Zwife fidisaka bawu. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuda yina vwandaka yekula Yesu zabisaka bawu kidimbu yina yandi ke sala: «Muntu yina mu ke fiba, ni yandi. Beno kanga yandi, mpe beno keba yandi mbote ntangu beno ke nata yandi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Kaka na ntangu yina Yuda kumaka, yandi kwendaka pene-pene ya Yesu, mpe tubaka: «Mulongisi!» Na manima, yandi fibaka Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Na yina, bawu simbaka Yesu mpe kangaka yandi. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Kasi mosi na kati ya bayina vwandaka kintwadi na Yesu, basisaka mbele ya yandi. Yandi bulaka yawu kisadi ya <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char> ya ntete, mpe zengaka yandi dikutu. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu zabisaka bawu: «Beno me kwiza na bambele mpe bayinti samu na kukanga munu mutindu ti mu vwandaka kimpumbulu? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Bilumbu nyonso mu vwandaka kintwadi na beno na kati ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> samu na kulongisa, mpe beno kangaka munu ve. Kasi mambu nyonso yayi me salama samu na kulungisa mambu yina kele na kati ya Dibuku ya Nzambi.»<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Na yina, bilandi nyonso bikaka Yesu, mpe kimaka. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Ditoko mosi vwandaka landa Yesu. Yandi lwataka kaka lele. Ba mekaka na kukanga yandi, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />kasi yandi bikaka lele, mpe kimaka kimpene.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na ntwala ya kimvuka ya bakuluntu ya ba-Zwife</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Lke 22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yne 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Bayina kangaka Yesu nataka yandi na yinzo ya <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char> ya ntete kisika vukanaka bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>, <char style="w">bakuluntu</char> ya ba-Zwife, mpe milongisi ya Misiku. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Pyele vwandaka landa Yesu mwa manima, mpe kotaka na lupangu ya <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char> ya ntete. Yandi vwandaka kisika mosi na mikengi, mpe vwandaka yotila tiya.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>, mpe kimvuka nyonso ya <char style="w">bakuluntu</char> ya ba-Zwife vwandaka sosa kimbangi samu na kuzengila yandi lufwa, kasi bawu kuzwaka ata dyambu. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Ya tsyelika, bantu mingi vwandaka tuba bimbangi ya luvunu na Nkumbu ya Yesu. Kasi bimbangi ya bawu vwandaka ya kuswaswana. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Na yina, mwa bantu ya nkaka telamaka, mpe tubaka kimbangi yayi ya luvunu: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Beto kuwaka yandi na kutuba ti yandi ke mwangisa Yinzo yayi ya Nzambi yina bantu tungaka, mpe na bilumbu tatu, yandi ke tunga dyaka ya nkaka yina bantu ke tunga ve.» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Kasi ata na kimbangi yayi, bambangi vwandaka wisana ve. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Na yina, <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char> ya ntete telamaka na kati-kati ya kimvuka, mpe yufulaka Yesu: «Nge kele ve na dyambu ya kutuba na mambu yina bantu yayi ke na kufunda nge?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Kasi Yesu pesaka mvutu ve, mpe vwandaka kaka swi. <char style="w">Nganga-Nzambi</char> ya ntete yufulaka dyaka yandi: «Nge kele <char style="w">Masiya</char>, <char style="w">Mwana ya Nzambi</char>* yina beto ke sambilaka?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu vutulaka: «Ee, ya kele munu, mpe beno ke tala Mwana ya Muntu ya kuvwanda na lubakala ya Nzambi-Mpungu, mpe yandi ke kwiza na kati ya matuti.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Na yina, <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char> ya ntete pasulaka bilele ya yandi, mpe tubaka: «Beto ke dyaka ve na nsatu ya bambangi! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Beno me kuwa mutindu yandi me safula Nzambi. Yinki beno ke na kubanza?» Bawu nyonso tubaka ti ba fwana kuzengila yandi kitumbu ya lufwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Mwa bantu ya nkaka na kati ya bawu lobolaka yandi mante. Bawu kangaka yandi kizizi, bulaka yandi makofi, mpe tubaka: «Bikula! Nani me bula nge?» Na manima, mikengi bakaka yandi, mpe bulaka yandi bambata.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyele mangaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lke 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yne 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Ntangu Pyele vwandaka na yisi, na kati ya lupangu, kisadi mosi ya kento ya <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char> ya ntete kwizaka kuna. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Yandi talaka Pyele yina vwandaka yotila tiya. Yandi talaka Pyele mbote, mpe tubaka: «Nge mpe, nge vwandaka kintwadi na Yesu, muntu ya Nazaleti.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Kasi Pyele mangaka mpe tubaka: «Mu zaba ve yinki nge ke na zola kutuba, mpe mu ke na kubakula ata dyambu.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:68">Na manima, Pyele kwendaka vwanda na mwelo ya lupangu. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Kasi kisadi yango talaka dyaka yandi, mpe tubaka na bayina vwandaka kuna: «Bakala yayi vwandaka na bawu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Pyele mangaka dyaka. Na manima ya mwa ntangu, bayina vwandaka kuna tubaka dyaka na Pyele: «Ya tsyelika, nge kele mosi ya bantu ya yandi samu ti nge mpe, nge kele muntu ya Ngalili.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Kasi Pyele zengaka ndefi mpe tubaka: «Mu zaba ve muntu yina beno ke na kuzonzila. Kana mu ke na kuvuna, bika ti Nzambi kupesa munu kitumbu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Kaka na ntangu yina, nsusu kubaka na mbala ya zole. Pyele bambukaka moyo na mambu yina Yesu zabisaka yandi: «Ntete nsusu kuba bambala zole, nge ke manga munu bambala tatu.» Na yina, Pyele basikaka mbangu mpe dilaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na ntwala ya Pilate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lke 23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yne 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Na suka-suka, bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>, <char style="w">bakuluntu</char> ya ba-Zwife, milongisi ya Misiku, mpe bantu nyonso ya kimvuka ya <char style="w">bakuluntu</char> ya ba-Zwife vukanaka. Bawu kangaka Yesu basinga. Bawu nataka yandi, mpe pesaka yandi na maboko ya Pilate. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilate yufulaka yandi: «Nge kele ntinu ya ba-Zwife?» Yesu vutulaka: «Nge ke na kutuba yawu nge mosi.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> vwandaka funda yandi na mambu mingi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Na yina, Pilate yufulaka dyaka yandi: «Nge ke na kuvutula dyambu ve? Nge ke na kuwa ve mambu nyonso yina bawu ke na kuzonza na nzutu ya nge!» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Kasi Yesu vutulaka dyaka ve mvutu, mpe Pilate yitukaka mingi.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba zengilaka Yesu lufwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lke 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yne 18.39–19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Na konso <char style="w">mukembo ya Paki</char>, Pilate vwandaka na kifu ya kupesa kimpwanza na nkole yina bantu vwandaka zola ti yandi basisa. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Kasi ya vwandaka na muntu mosi na nkumbu Balabase yina vwandaka na boloko na bimpumbulu ya nkaka, samu ti bawu kufwaka muntu ntangu bawu salaka muvusu. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Nkonga ya bantu kwendaka na yinzo ya Pilate, mpe bandaka na kulomba yandi mambu yina yandi vwandaka na kifu ya kusalaka. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilate vutulaka: «Beno zola ti mu pesa kimpwanza na ntinu ya ba-Zwife?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Ya tsyelika, Pilate zabaka ti bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> yekula Yesu na maboko ya yandi, samu ti bawu vwandaka tala yandi musoki. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Kasi bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> tumisaka nkonga na kulomba ti Pilate basisa Balabase na boloko. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilate zabisaka dyaka bawu: «Na yina, yinki beno zola ti mu sala na muntu yina beno ke bokilaka ntinu ya ba-Zwife?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Bawu lookaka: «Koma yandi na kulunsi!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilate yufulaka bawu: «Wapi dyambu ya yimbi yandi me sala?» Kasi bawu lookaka dyaka na ngolo nyonso: «Koma yandi na kulunsi!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilate vwandaka sosa kuyangidika nkonga. Na yina, yandi pesaka Balabase kimpwanza. Yandi tumisaka ti ba bula Yesu bikoti, mpe yekulaka yandi na maboko ya bawu samu na kukoma yandi na kulunsi.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Binwani sekaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yne 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Binwani nataka Yesu na yinzo ya mfumu Pilate, na kati ya lupangu, mpe bawu bokilaka binwani nyonso ya nkaka. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Bawu lwatisaka Yesu kiyunga ya mbwaki, mpe yimpu ya kintinu yina ba yidikaka na bansende. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Na manima, bawu vwandaka pesa yandi mbote na kutuba: «Mbote ya nge, ntinu ya ba-Zwife!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Bawu vwandaka bula yandi kidyadya na yintu, mpe vwandaka lobola yandi mante. Bawu vwandaka fukamaka mpe kondama na ntwala ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ntangu bawu manisaka na kuseka yandi, bawu katulaka yandi kiyunga, mpe lwatisaka yandi binkuti ya yandi. Na manima, bawu nataka yandi samu na kukoma yandi na kulunsi.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba komaka Yesu na kulunsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lke 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yne 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Bawu talaka muntu mosi na nkumbu Simoni yina katukaka na bilanga. Yandi vwandaka muntu ya mbanza Silene, mpe tata ya Alezande mpe Lufuse. Binwani tumisaka yandi na ngolo nyonso na kunata kulunsi ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Bawu nataka Yesu na kisika yina ba ke bokilaka Ngolongota, yina zola kutuba: «Kisika ya Mukwa ya yintu». <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Bawu zolaka pesa yandi vinu ya kuvukisa na mile, kasi Yesu mangaka. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Na manima, bawu komaka Yesu na kulunsi, kabulaka bawu na bawu binkuti ya yandi na kubula dzeke, samu na kuzaba yinki konso muntu ke kuzwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ya vwandaka ngunga ya yivwa ya suka ntangu bawu komaka Yesu na kulunsi. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Na dibaya yina vwandaka zabisa dyambu yina ba zengilaka yandi lufwa, ba sonikaka mutindu yayi: «Ntinu ya ba-Zwife». <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Bawu komaka mpe na bakulunsi bimpumbulu zole pene-pene ya Yesu: mosi na lubakala ya yandi, mpe ya nkaka na lumoso ya yandi [ <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Ni mutindu yina salamaka kibuku ya mambu ya Nzambi yina ke tubaka: «Ba tulaka yandi na lutangu ya bimpumbulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na babibiliya ya nkaka ya ntama, kitini yayi, ba bwelaka yawu na kubwela.</char></note>.»]<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Bantu yina vwandaka luta kuna, vwandaka finga yandi, mpe vwandaka ningisa yintu. Bawu vwandaka tuba: «Ee! Nge vwandaka zola kumwangisa <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, mpe kutunga dyaka yawu na bilumbu tatu! <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Na yina, vuukisa nzutu ya nge, mpe kulumuka na kulunsi!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Mutindu mosi mpe, bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> mpe milongisi ya Misiku vwandaka seka Yesu na kutuba bawu na bawu: «Yandi vuukisaka bantu ya nkaka, kasi yandi lenda kuvuukisa ve nzutu ya yandi mosi! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Kana yandi kele <char style="w">Masiya</char>, ntinu ya Isayeli, yandi kulumuka ntangu yayi na kulunsi samu ti beto tala mpe beto kwikila yandi.» Bayina ba komaka mpe na kulunsi kintwadi na Yesu vwandaka finga yandi.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lke 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yne 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Na ngunga ya midi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.33 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">ngunga ya midi </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:5">Mat 20.5</ref></char></note>, kitombe kumaka na yinsi nyonso tii na ngunga ya tatu na manima ya midi. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Na ngunga ya tatu na manima ya midi, Yesu lookaka na ndinga ya ngolo: «Eloyi, Eloyi, lema sabatani!» Ya zola kutuba: «Nzambi ya munu! Nzambi ya munu! Samu na yinki nge me bika munu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:2">Mga 22.2</ref></char></note>?» <figure style="fig" alt="La mort de Jésus" file="lb00324b.tif" size="col" loc="Marc 15.33-34" copy="Louise Bass" ref="15.34">Lufwa ya Yesu</figure><verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Bantu ya nkaka yina vwandaka kuna kuwaka yandi, mpe tubaka. «Beno kuwa! Yandi ke na kubokila Eli!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Mosi na kati ya bawu kwendaka baka mbangu kima mutindu mafudya. Yandi tulaka yawu malafu ya ngayi, mpe kangaka yawu na nsongi ya kidyadya. Yandi pesaka yawu na Yesu samu ti yandi kunwa, mpe tubaka: «Beno vingila! Beto tala ntete kana Eli ke kwiza kukatula yandi na kulunsi.» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Kasi Yesu lookaka ngolo, mpe kufwaka.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Lele yina ke kabulaka bisika ya longo ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> pasukaka na kati-kati na bandambu zole kubanda na zulu tii na yisi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Ntangu mfumu ya binwani ya Loma yina vwandaka na ntwala ya Yesu talaka mutindu Yesu kufwaka, yandi tubaka: «Ya tsyelika, muntu yayi vwandaka <char style="w">Mwana ya Nzambi</char>.» <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ndambu ya bakento vwandaka mpe kuna. Bawu vwandaka ya kutelama mwa ntama, mpe vwandaka tala. Na kati ya bawu vwandaka: Maliya ya mbanza Madala, Maliya mama ya Zaki ya ntwenya mpe Yoze, mpe kento ya nkaka na nkumbu Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Bawu landaka Yesu mpe sadilaka yandi ntangu yandi vwandaka na Ngalili. Ya vwandaka kuna mpe na bakento mingi ya nkaka yina kwizaka na Yesu na Yelusalemi.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba tulaka nzutu ya Yesu na kati ya ndyamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lke 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yne 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Ya vwandaka kuma mpimpa, mpe ya vwandaka kilumbu ya kukubika saba. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosefi, muntu ya mbanza Alimate kwizaka kuna. Yandi vwandaka muntu ya mfunu na kati ya <char style="w">kimvuka ya bakuluntu ya ba-Zwife</char>. Yandi mpe vwandaka vingila nkwizulu ya <char style="w">Kimfumu ya Nzambi</char>. Na kibakala nyonso, yandi kwendaka tala Pilate, mpe lombaka yandi nzutu ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Kasi Pilate yitukaka na kuwa ti Yesu me kufwa. Na yina, yandi bokilaka mfumu ya binwani, mpe yufulaka yandi kana Yesu kufwaka ntama. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Na manima ya kuwa mvutu ya mfumu ya binwani, yandi pesaka Yosefi muswa ya kubaka nzutu ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosefi sumbaka lele ya lino, mpe katulaka nzutu ya Yesu na kulunsi. Yandi zingaka yawu na lele ya lino, mpe tulaka yawu na kati ya ndyamu yina ba timunaka na mongo ya matadi. Na manima, yandi vindumunaka ditadi ya nene samu na kukanga ndyamu. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maliya ya mbanza Madala, mpe Maliya mama ya Yoze vwandaka tala kisika ba vwandaka tula nzutu ya Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Mvumbukulu ya Yesu na lufwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lke 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yne 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ntangu kilumbu ya <char style="w">Saba</char> lutaka, Maliya ya mbanza ya Madala, Maliya mama ya Zaki, mpe kento ya nkaka na nkumbu Salome, sumbaka mananasi samu na kutula na nzutu ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Na suka-suka ya kilumbu ya lumingu, bawu kwendaka na ndyamu. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Bawu vwandaka tuba bawu na bawu: «Nani ke vindumuna beto ditadi yina kele na mwelo ya ndyamu?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Kasi ntangu bawu kumaka, bawu talaka ti ditadi yango ya nene vwandaka me vindumuka na lweka. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Na yina, bawu kotaka na ndyamu, mpe talaka ditoko mosi yina lwataka dizwela ya mpembe. Yandi vwandaka ya kuvwanda na lubakala, mpe bawu kumaka na boma. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Kasi yandi zabisaka bawu: «Beno vwanda na boma ve. Beno ke na kusosa Yesu ya Nazaleti yina ba komaka na kulunsi! Yandi kele ve awa. Yandi me vumbuka na lufwa. Beno tala kisika yina ba tulaka yandi. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ntangu yayi, beno kwenda kutuba mutindu yayi na bilandi ya yandi mpe na Pyele: “Yandi ke na kuvingila beno na Ngalili. Ni kuna beno ke tala yandi mutindu yandi zabisaka beno yawu.” » <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Bawu basikaka na ndyamu, mpe kimaka ntama samu ti bawu vwandaka tekita na boma. Na yina, bawu tubaka ata dyambu na muntu samu na boma.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 16:8">Yesu talanaka na sika ya bilandi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yne 20.11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[ <verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Na manima ya kuvumbuka na lufwa na kilumbu ya lumingu, Yesu talanaka ntete na Maliya ya mbanza Madala yina yandi bingisa bampeve nsambwadi ya yimbi. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Yandi kwendaka zabisa yawu na bilandi ya Yesu. Bawu vwandaka na kyadi, mpe vwandaka dila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Yandi zabisaka bawu: «Yesu kele moyo, mu me tala yandi.» Kasi bawu kwikilaka yandi ve.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu talanaka na sika ya bilandi zole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Lke 24.13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Na manima, Yesu talanaka na mutindu ya nkaka na bilandi zole yina vwandaka kwenda na bwala. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Bawu vutukaka mpe zabisaka yawu na bilandi ya nkaka. Kasi bawu mpe kwikilaka ve.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu talanaka na sika ya bilandi kumi na mosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lke 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yne 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bis 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Na manima, Yesu talanaka na bilandi ya yandi kumi na mosi ntangu bawu vwandaka kudya. Yesu sembaka bawu samu ti bawu vwandaka ve na kiminu, mpe bawu kwikilaka ve bantu yina talaka yandi moyo na manima ya kuvumbuka na lufwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Na manima, yandi zabisaka bawu. «Beno kwenda na yinza ya muvimba samu na kumwangisa Nsangu ya Mbote na sika ya bantu nyonso. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Muntu yina ke kwikila mpe ke ndima na kuzwa mbotokolo, ke kuzwa mpulusu. Kasi muntu yina ke kwikila ve, ke kuzwa kitumbu. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Bayina ke kwikila, ke vwanda na bidimbu yayi: na Nkumbu ya munu, bawu ke bingisa bampeve ya yimbi, mpe ke zonza bandinga ya malu-malu. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Ata dyambu ya yimbi ke kumina bawu, kana bawu simba banyoka na maboko to bawu kunwa manganga ya yimbi yina ke kufwaka bantu. Bawu ke tentika maboko na bambevo, mpe bambevo ke beluka.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nangukaka na zulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Lke 24.50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bis 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Na manima ya kuzabisa bawu mutindu yina, <char style="w">Mfumu</char> Yesu nangukaka na zulu, mpe kwendaka vwanda na lubakala ya Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Bilandi kwendaka zabisa Nsangu ya Mbote na bisika nyonso. <char style="w">Mfumu</char> vwandaka sala kintwadi na bawu, mpe vwandaka lakisa butsyelika ya mambu yina bawu vwandaka zabisa na bidimbu ya ngitukulu yina bawu vwandaka sala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na mabuku ya nkaka ya ntama, bibuku kubanda na 9 tii na 20, ba bwelaka yawu na kubwela.</char></note>.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>